{"id": "6th-t1-u3-062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-6th-u3-kalvi", "lesson_id": "lesson-04-noolagam-nokki", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-ranganathan-award-name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சிறந்த நூலகர்களுக்குத் தமிழ்நாடு அரசு வழங்கும் உயரிய விருதின் பெயர் என்ன?\nஅ) நல்லாசிரியர் விருது\nஆ) டாக்டர் ச.ரா. அரங்கநாதன் விருது\nஇ) கலைமாமணி விருது\nஈ) திருவள்ளுவர் விருது", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ", "B": "ஆ", "C": "இ", "D": "ஈ"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் தெரிந்து தெளிவோம் (பக்கம் 54): 'சிறந்த நூலகர்களுக்கு முனைவர் ச.ரா. அரங்கநாதன் விருது வழங்கப்படுகிறது.'"}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the prestigious award conferred by the Tamil Nadu Government to outstanding librarians?\nA) Nallaasiriyar Award\nB) Dr. S.R. Ranganathan Award\nC) Kalaimamani Award\nD) Thiruvalluvar Award", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A", "B": "B", "C": "C", "D": "D"}, "explanation": "Textbook Page 54: The award conferred on outstanding librarians is named after Dr. S.R. Ranganathan."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": false, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "textbook", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", 