{"id": "9th-u1-q061", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "quote_completion", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-thithikkum-thellamudhai-poem", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தித்திக்கும் தெள்ளமுதாய் தெள்ளமுதின் மேலான\nமுத்திக் கனியேஎன் முத்தமிழே...'\nஇவ்வடிகளில் 'முத்திக்கனி' என்பது எவ்வகை இலக்கணக் குறிப்பைக் குறிக்கிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உருவகம்", "B": "உவமைத்தொகை", "C": "பண்புத்தொகை", "D": "வினையெச்சம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக். 3 இலக்கணக் குறிப்பு: முத்திக் கனி = உருவகம் (முத்தியாகிய கனி). முத்தமிழ் = பண்புத்தொகை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the opening couplet of Tamilvidu Thoothu, 'Muthikkaniye En Muthamizhe', what grammatical device does 'Muthikkani' represent?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Metaphor (Uruvagam)", "B": "Simile Compound (Uvamaithogai)", "C": "Descriptive Compound (Panbuthogai)", "D": "Adverbial Participle (Vinaiyecham)"}, "explanation": "'Muthikkani' (fruit of liberation) is an absolute metaphor (Uruvagam) specified on textbook page 3."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year",