{"id": "9th-u1-q062", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "statement_analysis", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-9th-u1-mozhi", "lesson_id": "lesson-02-tamilvidu-thoothu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-moovinam-thuthor", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'குறமென்றும் பள்ளென்றும் கொள்வார் கொடுப்பாய்க்கு\nஉறவென்று மூன்று இனத்தும் உண்டோ...'\nஇப்பாடல் அடியில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் 'மூன்று இனம்' என்பவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தமிழ், தெலுங்கு, கன்னடம்", "B": "துறை, தாழிசை, விருத்தம்", "C": "இயல், இசை, நாடகம்", "D": "அறம், பொருள், இன்பம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் சொல்லும் பொருளும்: மூன்று இனம் = பாவினங்கள் ஆகிய துறை, தாழிசை, விருத்தம் என்பனவாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In the couplet 'Uravendru Moondru Inathum Undoo', what do the 'Three Inams' (மூன்று இனம்) refer to?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tamil, Telugu, and Kannada", "B": "Thurai, Thaazhisai, and Viruttham", "C": "Iyal, Isai, and Naadagam", "D": "Aram, Porul, and Inbam"}, "explanation": "The three poetic sub-meters (Paavinangal) are Thurai, Thaazhisai, and Viruttham."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 2, 