{"id": "9th-u4-q079", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kudumba-vilakku-lines3", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சமைப்பது என்பது உணவை மட்டுமன்று, __________ சமைப்பது ஆகும்\" எனத் தலைவி கூறுகிறாள்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருளை", "B": "புகழை", "C": "இன்பத்தை", "D": "செல்வத்தை"}, "explanation": "'இன்பம் சமைப்பவர் சமையல் செய்வார்' என்பதன் மூலம் உணவை ஆக்குவது வெறும் வயிற்றுப்பசியைத் தீர்ப்பது மட்டுமன்று, குடும்பத்திற்கு இன்பத்தை சமைப்பது ஆகும் எனத் தலைவி கூறுகிறாள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Cooking does not merely produce food, but rather it cooks/creates __________\" - What does the matriarch state?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Material wealth", "B": "Fame", "C": "Joy and happiness (Inbam)", "D": "Gold and treasures"}, "explanation": "The matriarch expresses that cooking is crafting joy ('Inbam samaippavar samaiyal seivaar'), feeding love and happiness into the family."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 88, "chapter": null, "section": null, 