{"id": "9th-u4-q085", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-intro", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒன்றறி வதுவே உற்றறி வதுவே / இரண்டறி வதுவே அதனொடு நாவே...\" - என்னும் பாடல் வரிகள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம்", "B": "நன்னூல்", "C": "வீரசோழியம்", "D": "யாப்பருங்கலக்காரிகை"}, "explanation": "உயிரினங்களின் அறிவு வளர்ச்சியை ஓரறிவு முதல் ஆறறிவு வரை பாகுபடுத்திக் கூறும் இப்பாடல் தொல்காப்பியத்தில் பொருளதிகாரத்தில் உள்ள மரபியலில் (நூற்பா 1516) இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Ondrari vadhuve uttrari vadhuve / Irandari vadhuve adhanodu naave...\" - In which ancient grammatical treatise do these lines classifying sensory stages occur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tholkappiyam", "B": "Nannool", "C": "Veerasozhiyam", "D": "Yaapparungalak-kaarigai"}, "explanation": "These lines systematically classifying living organisms from one to six senses occur in Tholkappiyam (Porulathikaaram, Marabiyal Sutra 1516)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 90", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "uyir_vagai", "tholkappiyam"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q086", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-classification", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் கூற்றுப்படி 'மூன்றறிவு' கொண்ட உயிரினங்களுக்கு உரிய எடுத்துக்காட்டுகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிப்பி, நத்தை", "B": "கரையான், எறும்பு", "C": "நண்டு, தும்பி", "D": "புல், மரம்"}, "explanation": "மூன்றறி வதுவே அதனொடு மூக்கே - தொடு உணர்வு, சுவைத்தல், நுகர்தல் ஆகிய மூன்று அறிவுகளைப் பெற்றுள்ள உயிரினங்கள் கரையான் மற்றும் எறும்பு ஆகும். சிப்பி, நத்தை - ஈரறிவு; நண்டு, தும்பி - நான்கறிவு; புல், மரம் - ஓரறிவு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyar, which creatures are categorized as possessing three senses (Moondrarivu: touch, taste, smell)?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Oyster, Snail", "B": "Termite, Ant", "C": "Crab, Dragonfly / Beetle", "D": "Grass, Tree"}, "explanation": "Termites and ants possess three senses (touch, taste, and smell). Oysters and snails have two senses; crabs and dragonflies have four; grass and trees have one sense."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 90", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "uyir_vagai", "classification"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q087", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (அறிவு நிலை - உயிரினங்கள்):\n(a) ஓரறிவு - 1. நண்டு, தும்பி\n(b) ஈரறிவு - 2. புல், மரம்\n(c) நான்கறிவு - 3. சிப்பி, நத்தை\n(d) ஐந்தறிவு - 4. பறவை, விலங்கு", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: ஓரறிவு - புல், மரம் (உற்றறிதல்); ஈரறிவு - சிப்பி, நத்தை (உற்றறிதல் + சுவை); நான்கறிவு - நண்டு, தும்பி (உற்றறிதல் + சுவை + நுகர்தல் + காணல்); ஐந்தறிவு - பறவை, விலங்கு (செவி அறிவும் சேர்ந்தது)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the sensory hierarchy with the respective organisms:\n(a) One sense - 1. Crab, Dragonfly\n(b) Two senses - 2. Grass, Tree\n(c) Four senses - 3. Oyster, Snail\n(d) Five senses - 4. Bird, Animal", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-3, (b)-2, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-1, (d)-4", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-1, (c)-3, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "Accurate mapping: One sense = Grass, Tree; Two senses = Oyster, Snail; Four senses = Crab, Dragonfly; Five senses = Bird, Animal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 90", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "uyir_vagai", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q088", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-sixth-sense", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியர் கூற்றுப்படி மனிதனுக்குரிய 'ஆறாவது அறிவு' என எதனைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கண் (காணல்)", "B": "செவி (கேட்டல்)", "C": "மூக்கு (நுகர்தல்)", "D": "மனம் (பகுத்தறிதல்)"}, "explanation": "'ஆறறி வதுவே அதனொடு மனனே / நேரிதின் உணர்ந்தோர் நெறிப்படுத்தினரே' என்று தொல்காப்பியர் ஐந்து புலன் உணர்வுகளோடு 'மனம்' என்னும் பகுத்தறிவை ஆறாவது அறிவாக மனிதனுக்குக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Tholkappiyar, what is identified as the 'Sixth Sense' unique to human beings?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Eye (Sight)", "B": "Ear (Hearing)", "C": "Nose (Smell)", "D": "Mind (Rationality / Discernment - Manam)"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyar identifies 'Manam' (the conscious rational mind / intellect) as the sixth sense added to the five physical sensory perceptions."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 90", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "uyir_vagai", "sixth_sense"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q089", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tholkappiyam-structure", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியத்தில் உள்ள மொத்த அதிகாரங்கள் மற்றும் இயல்களின் எண்ணிக்கை முறையே யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 அதிகாரங்கள், 27 இயல்கள்", "B": "4 அதிகாரங்கள், 28 இயல்கள்", "C": "3 அதிகாரங்கள், 30 இயல்கள்", "D": "2 அதிகாரங்கள், 18 இயல்கள்"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பியம் எழுத்து, சொல், பொருள் என 3 அதிகாரங்களைக் கொண்டுள்ளது. ஒவ்வொரு அதிகாரமும் 9 இயல்கள் வீதம் மொத்தம் 27 இயல்களைக் கொண்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the total number of sections (Athikaaram) and chapters (Iyalgiram) in Tholkappiyam respectively?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "3 Athikaarams, 27 Iyals", "B": "4 Athikaarams, 28 Iyals", "C": "3 Athikaarams, 30 Iyals", "D": "2 Athikaarams, 18 Iyals"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyam consists of 3 major sections (Ezhuthu, Chol, Porul) and each section contains 9 chapters, totaling 27 Iyals."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 91, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 91", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "tholkappiyam", "structure"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q090", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multi_statement", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tholkappiyam-linguistics", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தொல்காப்பியம் பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. தமிழின் மிகப்பழமையான இலக்கண நூல் தொல்காப்பியம்.\n2. இதன் பொருளதிகாரம் அகத்திணை, புறத்திணை வாழ்வியல் நெறிகளோடு செய்யுள், அணி, மரபியல் கோட்பாடுகளையும் கூறுகிறது.\n3. எழுத்துகள் பிறக்கும் முறையை உடற்கூற்றியல் அடிப்படையில் இன்றைய மொழியியலாளர்கள் வியக்கும் வண்ணம் விளக்கியுள்ளார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மற்றும் 2 மட்டும் சரி", "B": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி", "C": "2 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி", "D": "1 மற்றும் 3 மட்டும் சரி"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பியம் தமிழின் தொன்மையான இலக்கண நூல். பொருளதிகாரம் வாழ்வியல் மற்றும் இலக்கியக் கோட்பாடுகளைக் கூறுகிறது. பிறப்பியலில் உடற்கூற்றியல் அடிப்படையில் எழுத்துப் பிறப்பு விளக்கப்பட்டுள்ளது. எனவே மூன்றும் சரியானவை."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine the following statements concerning Tholkappiyam:\n1. Tholkappiyam is the most ancient extant Tamil grammatical treatise.\n2. Its Porulathikaaram details socio-cultural living ethics (Agam/Puram) along with poetics, metrics, and stylistic conventions.\n3. It explains phonetic articulation of speech sounds on an anatomical basis admired by modern linguists.\nWhich of the statements are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only are correct", "B": "All 1, 2, and 3 are correct", "C": "2 and 3 only are correct", "D": "1 and 3 only are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements are true. Tholkappiyam is the oldest grammar work, covers social/poetic theory in Porulathikaaram, and explains articulatory phonetics anatomically in Pirappiyal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 91, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 91", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_4", "tholkappiyam", "linguistics"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u4-q091", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u4", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u4-l3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uyir-vagai-senses", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"நான்கறி வதுவே அதனொடு கண்ணே\" - இதில் நான்காவது அறிவாகத் தொல்காப்பியர் குறிப்பிடுவது எதனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுவைத்தல் (நாக்கு)", "B": "நுகர்தல் (மூக்கு)", "C": "காணல் (கண்)", "D": "கேட்டல் (செவி)"}, "explanation": "ஓரறிவு - தொடுதல்; ஈரறிவு - சுவைத்தல்; மூவறிவு - நுகர்தல்; நான்கறிவு - காணல் (கண்); ஐந்தறிவு - கேட்டல் (செவி); ஆறறிவு - பகுத்தறிதல் (மனம்). எனவே நான்காவது அறிவு 'காணல்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Naankari vadhuve adhanodu kanne\" - Which faculty does Tholkappiyar assign as the fourth sense?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Taste (Tongue)", "B": "Smell (Nose)", "C": "Sight / Vision (Eye)", "D": "Hearing (Ear)"}, "explanation": "1st = Touch, 2nd = Taste, 3rd = Smell, 4th = Sight (Kanne / Eye), 5th = Hearing (Ear), 6th = Rational mind."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 90, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference":