{"id": "9th-u5-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "assertion_reason", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sculpture-granite-assertion", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கூற்று (A): பல்லவர் காலத்தில் தமிழ்ச் சிற்பக்கலை பெரும் திருப்புமுனையைப் பெற்றது.\nகாரணம் (R): அதுவரை மரம், செங்கல், சுதை போன்றவற்றால் சிற்பங்கள் செய்துவந்த நிலையை மாற்றி, பாறைகளைக் குடைந்து அழியாச் சிற்பங்களை வடித்தனர்.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) சரி, ஆனால் (R) தவறு", "B": "(A) தவறு, ஆனால் (R) சரி", "C": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் சரி; மேலும் (R) என்பது (A) விற்கு சரியான விளக்கம்", "D": "(A) மற்றும் (R) இரண்டும் தவறு"}, "explanation": "பல்லவர்கள் காலத்தில்தான் பாறைகளைக் குடைந்து அழியாத கருங்கல் சிற்பங்கள் வடிக்கப்பட்டு மாபெரும் கலைப்புரட்சி ஏற்பட்டது. எனவே கூற்று, காரணம் இரண்டும் சரி, தக்க விளக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Assertion (A): Tamil sculptural art witnessed a revolutionary turning point during the Pallava period.\nReason (R): They moved past perishable wood, brick, and stucco to carve rock-cut cave shrines and monolithic granitic monuments.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(A) is true, but (R) is false", "B": "(A) is false, but (R) is true", "C": "Both (A) and (R) are true, and (R) is the correct explanation of (A)", "D": "Both (A) and (R) are false"}, "explanation": "Both assertion and reason are historically accurate; the Pallava transition from perishable media to hard stone defined classical Tamil architecture."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 109, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 109", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_5", "sculpture", "assertion_reason"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u5-q016", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u5", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u5-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pillayarpatti-sculpture", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாண்டியர் காலக் குடைவரைச் சிற்பங்களில் சிறப்புப் பெற்ற பிள்ளையார்பட்டி குடைவரைக் கோயிலின் முதன்மைக் கடவுள் வடிவம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முருகன்", "B": "நடராசர்", "C": "திருமால்", "D": "கற்பக விநாயகர்"}, "explanation": "சிவகங்கை மாவட்டம் பிள்ளையார்பட்டியில் உள்ள பாண்டியர் காலக் குடைவரைக் கோயிலில் பாறையிலேயே புடைப்பாகச் செதுக்கப்பட்ட 'கற்பக விநாயகர்' சிற்பம் உலகப் புகழ்பெற்றதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which iconic deity is hewn out of living rock in the famed Pandya cave temple of Pillaiyarpatti?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Murugan", "B": "Nataraja", "C": "Vishnu", "D": "Karpaga Vinayagar (Ganesha)"}, "explanation": "The massive rock-cut Karpaga Vinayagar relief at Pillaiyarpatti is a paramount example of early Pandya cave carving."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 110, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9t