{"id": "9th-u7-q040", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "netaji-quotes-comparison", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நேதாஜியின் பின்வரும் உரைகளில் 'போர்க்கள அழைப்பாக' அமைந்த முழக்கம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒற்றுமையே பலம்", "B": "அகிம்சையே நமது ஆயுதம்", "C": "சத்தியமே வெல்லும்", "D": "டெல்லி சலோ மற்றும் இரத்தம் தாருங்கள் சுதந்திரம் தருகிறேன்"}, "explanation": "நேதாஜியின் போர்க்கள முழக்கங்களாக 'டெல்லி சலோ' (டெல்லி நோக்கிச் செல்லுங்கள்) மற்றும் 'இரத்தம் தாருங்கள் சுதந்திரம் தருகிறேன்' ஆகியவை அமைந்தன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of Netaji's proclamations served as the direct revolutionary battlefield call to arms?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Unity is strength", "B": "Non-violence is our weapon", "C": "Truth alone triumphs", "D": "Delhi Chalo and 'Give me blood, I will give you freedom' (டெல்லி சலோ)"}, "explanation": "Netaji's explosive battle cries 'Delhi Chalo' and 'Give me blood, I shall give you freedom' galvanized armed rebellion against colonial rule."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 131, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 131", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "netaji", "war_cry"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q041", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ina-burma-retreat-tamils", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இரண்டாம் உலகப்போரின் முடிவில் ஜப்பான் பின்வாங்கிய போது, பர்மாவிலிருந்து இந்தியா நோக்கி நடந்த பின்வாங்கலில் தமிழர்கள் காட்டிய தலைமைப் பண்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உயிரைப் பணயம் வைத்து நேதாஜியையும் உடன் போரிட்ட வீரர்களையும் பாதுகாத்தமை", "B": "ஆங்கிலேயரிடம் உடனே சரணடைந்தமை", "C": "ஆயுதங்களை அங்கேயே விட்டுவிட்டுத் தப்பியமை", "D": "தனி நாடாக அறிவித்துக் கொண்டமை"}, "explanation": "போரின் நெருக்கடியான பின்வாங்கல் சூழலிலும் தமிழ் வீரர்கள் தளராது நேதாஜியையும் தங்கள் சக தோழர்களையும் பர்மியக் காடுகள் வழியே பாதுகாப்பாக வழிநடத்தினர்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "During the arduous retreat from Burma towards the end of WWII, what exemplary valor did Tamil INA soldiers display?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Courageously risking their lives to escort Netaji and fellow soldiers to safety through hostile terrain", "B": "Immediately surrendering to the British", "C": "Abandoning their arms and fleeing", "D": "Declaring an independent state"}, "explanation": "Tamil soldiers formed Netaji's personal bodyguard and frontline defense during the harrowing Burma retreat."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_