{"id": "9th-u7-q058", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sivaka-chinthamani-meter", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தமிழில் 'விருத்தப்பாக்களால்' இயற்றப்பட்ட முதல் காப்பியம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிலப்பதிகாரம்", "B": "சீவக சிந்தாமணி", "C": "மணிமேகலை", "D": "கம்பராமாயணம்"}, "explanation": "தமிழிலக்கிய வரலாற்றில் முதன்முதலில் விருத்தப்பா என்ற புதிய செய்யுள் வகையால் முழுமையாகப் பாடப்பட்ட பெருங்காப்பியம் சீவக சிந்தாமணி ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which was the very first epic in Tamil literature to be composed entirely in 'Viruthappa' poetic meter?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Silappadikaram", "B": "Sivaka Chinthamani (சீவக சிந்தாமணி)", "C": "Manimekalai", "D": "Kamba Ramayanam"}, "explanation": "Sivaka Chinthamani holds the literary distinction of being the first epic composed in Virutham meter."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 136", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "meter"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q060", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sivaka-chinthamani-other-name", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சீவகன் எட்டுப் பெண்களை முறைப்படி மணம் புரிந்த வரலாற்றைக் கூறுவதால் இந்நூலுக்கு வழங்கும் வேறு பெயர் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "குடிமக்கள் காப்பியம்", "B": "பக்தி நூல்", "C": "இயற்கைக் காப்பியம்", "D": "மணநூல்"}, "explanation": "சீவகன் காந்தருவதத்தை, குணமாலை முதலான எட்டு மங்கையரை மணம் முடித்த சிறப்பால் சீவக சிந்தாமணிக்கு 'மணநூல்' என்ற வேறுபெயரும் உண்டு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Because the epic chronicles the hero Sivakan marrying eight maidens in succession, what alternate title is it renowned by?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kudimakkal Kaappiyam", "B": "Bhakti Nool", "C": "Iyarkai Kaappiyam", "D": "Mananool (மணநூல் - The Book of Marriages)"}, "explanation": "Sivaka Chinthamani is widely acclaimed as 'Mananool' (The Book of Marriages) as each canto leads to a wedding."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 136", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "mananool"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q072", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paddy-snake-simile", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சொல்லரும் சூல்பசும் பாம்பின் தோற்றம் போல் / மெல்லவே கருவிருந்து... இறைஞ்சி காய்த்தவே\" - இப்பாடலில் பயின்றுவந்துள்ள அணி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வேற்றுமையணி", "B": "உருவகவணி", "C": "பின்வருநிலையணி", "D": "உவமையணி"}, "explanation": "கருவுற்ற பச்சைப்பாம்பு போல நெற்கதிர் தோன்றி, கீழ்மக்களின் செல்வம் போல தலைநிமிர்ந்து, பின்னர் கற்றறிந்த சான்றோரைப் போல தலைவணங்கி விளைந்தது என 'போல்' என்னும் உவம உருபு வெளிப்பட்டு வந்ததால் இது 'உவமையணி' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Sollarum soolpasum paambin thotram pol... irainji kaaythave\" - Which figure of speech is employed in this verse comparing ripening paddy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vettrumai Ani (Contrast)", "B": "Uruvaga Ani (Metaphor)", "C": "Pinvarunilai Ani", "D": "Uvamai Ani (உவமையணி - Simile)"}, "explanation": "The explicit use of the comparative particle 'pol' to liken the green sprouting sheath to a gravid green snake constitutes Uvamai Ani (Simile)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 135", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "uvamai_ani"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q073", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paddy-humility-moral", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முற்றிய நெற்கதிர்கள் வளைந்து தலைவணங்கி நிற்பதற்கு ஆசிரியர் யாரை உவமையாகக் கூறுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூல்களைக் கற்றுத் தேர்ந்த அறிவுடைய சான்றோரை", "B": "பண்பற்ற செல்வந்தர்களை", "C": "போர்க்கள வீரர்களை", "D": "உழவர்களை"}, "explanation": "'தேர்ந்தநூல் கல்விசேர் மாந்தரின் இறைஞ்சி காய்த்தவே' - நல்ல நூல்களைக் கற்றுத் தேர்ந்த பண்புடைய சான்றோர்கள் அடக்கத்தோடு தலைவணங்கி நிற்பது போல நெற்கதிர் விளைந்து வளைந்து நின்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To whom does the poet compare the mature, bowed-down stalks of golden ripening paddy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Wise, learned scholars characterized by humility and profound erudition", "B": "Arrogant, wealthy aristocrats", "C": "Warriors on the battlefield", "D": "Farmers tilling the soil"}, "explanation": "Thiruthakkadevar compares the bowing ears of ripe paddy to erudite scholars who bow in humility."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 135, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 135", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "sivaka_chinthamani", "humility_simile"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q076", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ilakkana-kurippu-kodiyanar", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'கொடியன்னார்' என்பது செய்யுளில் 'கொடியனார்' என இடைநிலை எழுத்துக் குறைந்து வருவது எவ்வகை இலக்கணம்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முதற்குறை", "B": "கடைக்குறை", "C": "இயல்பு", "D": "இடைக்குறை"}, "explanation": "'கொடியன்னார்' என்ற சொல்லின் இடையில் உள்ள னகர ஒற்று குறைந்து 'கொடியனார்' என நின்றதால் இது 'இடைக்குறை' விகாரம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In poetry, when 'Kodiyannaar' is compressed to 'Kodiyanar' with a middle letter elided, what is this phonetic reduction termed?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mudharkkurai (Initial syncope)", "B": "Kadaikkurai (Apocope)", "C": "Iyalbu (Natural)", "D": "Idaikkurai (இடைக்குறை - Medial syncope)"}, "explanation": "The dropping of a middle letter for metrical rhythm in poetry is designated Idaikkurai."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 136, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 136", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_7", "ilakkana_kurippu", "idaikkurai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u7-q078", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mu-va-quote-virutham", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தமிழிலக்கிய வரலாற்றில் ஒன்பதாம் நூற்றாண்டில் விருத்தம் என்ற புதிய செய்யுள் வகையைப் பயன்படுத்தி மூவாயிரத்துக்கும் மேற்பட்ட பாடல்கள் கொண்ட காப்பியம் பாடியவர் திருத்தக்கதேவர்\" - எனக் குறிப்பிட்ட தமிழறிஞர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உ.வே. சாமிநாதையர்", "B": "டாக்டர் மு. வரதராசனார்", "C": "மறைமலையடிகள்", "D": "பாரதிதாசன்"}, "explanation": "விருத்தப்பாவால் காப்பியம் இயற்றிய திருத்தக்கதேவரின் இலக்கியப் புரட்சியைப் பாடநூலில் புகழ்ந்துரைத்தவர் டாக்டர் மு. வரதராசனார் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which eminent Tamil scholar praised Thiruthakkadevar for introducing Virutham meter to compose over 3,000 epic verses in the 9th Century?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "U.Ve. Swaminatha Iyer", "B": "Dr. Mu. Varadarajanar (மு. வரதராசனார்)", "C": "Maraimalai Adigal", "D": "Bharathidasan"}, "explanation": "Dr. Mu. Varadarajanar documented and commended Thiruthakkadevar's pioneering genius in Virutham verse."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educ