{"id": "9th-u7-q138", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "application", "level": "application", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u7", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u7-l4", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "december-soodinaal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'டிசம்பர் சூடினாள்' - இதில் 'டிசம்பர்' என்னும் மாதத்தின் பெயர் அம்மாதத்தில் பூக்கும் பூவுக்கு ஆகிவருவது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இடவாகுபெயர்", "B": "காலவாகுபெயர்", "C": "பொருளாகுபெயர்", "D": "சினையாகுபெயர்"}, "explanation": "'டிசம்பர்' என்னும் காலப்பெயர், அக்காலத்தில் மலரும் டிசம்பர் பூவுக்கு ஆகிவந்ததால் இது 'காலவாகுபெயர்' ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In 'டிசம்பர் சூடினாள்' (She adorned December flowers), the calendar month name applying to the seasonal flower represents which Aagupeyar?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Idavaagupeyar", "B": "Kaalavaagupeyar (காலவாகுபெயர் - Temporal month-for-flower)", "C": "Porulaagupeyar", "D": "Sinaiyaagupeyar"}, "explanation": "The month 'December' (time) stands for the flower blooming in that season, marking Kaalavaagupeyar."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 65, "chapter": null, "sectio