{"id": "9th-u8-q024", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-viduthalai-daily", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தந்தை பெரியார் தொடங்கி இன்று வரை வெளிவந்து கொண்டிருக்கும் சமூகச் சீர்திருத்த நாளிதழ் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுதேசமித்திரன்", "B": "தினமணி", "C": "நவசக்தி", "D": "விடுதலை"}, "explanation": "தந்தை பெரியாரால் 1935-இல் தொடங்கப்பட்ட 'விடுதலை' நாளிதழ் பகுத்தறிவுக் கொள்கைகளைத் தொடர்ந்து பரப்பி வருகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which social reform daily newspaper founded by Thanthai Periyar continues publication to this day?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Swadesamitran", "B": "Dinamani", "C": "Navasakti", "D": "Viduthalai (விடுதலை)"}, "explanation": "Periyar founded the Tamil daily 'Viduthalai' in 1935 as a fearless vehicle for rationalist social reform."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 156", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "viduthalai"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-caste-eradication", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பெரியாரின் சாதி ஒழிப்புச் சிந்தனையின் அடிப்படை நோக்கம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பிறப்பொக்கும் எல்லா உயிர்க்கும் என்ற சமத்துவத்தை நிலைநிறுத்தி மனிதனை மனிதனாக மதிப்பது", "B": "புதிய சாதிகளை உருவாக்குவது", "C": "சாதி சங்கங்களை வளர்ப்பது", "D": "ஒரு சாதியை மட்டும் உயர்த்துவது"}, "explanation": "பிறப்பினால் எவரும் உயர்ந்தவரோ தாழ்ந்தவரோ அல்ல; மனிதனை மனிதனாக மதிக்கும் சமத்துவ சமுதாயத்தை உருவாக்குவதே பெரியாரின் சாதி ஒழிப்பு நோக்கமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the foundational objective of Periyar's radical campaign for the annihilation of caste?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Establishing universal equality based on human dignity and mutual respect", "B": "Creating novel caste divisions", "C": "Strengthening caste associations", "D": "Elevating a single dominant community"}, "explanation": "Periyar sought to abolish all birth-based hierarchies to establish absolute social equality and human brotherhood."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 155, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 155", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "equality"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "unesco-citation-words", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "யுனெஸ்கோ மன்றம் பெரியாரைப் பாராட்டி வழங்கிய பாராட்டுரையின் தொடக்கம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இந்தியாவின் தேசத்தந்தை...", "B": "புது உலகத்தின் தொலைநோக்காளர்; தெற்கு ஆசியாவின் சாக்ரடீஸ்...", "C": "ஆசியாவின் அமைதித் தூதர்...", "D": "தமிழினத்தின் தவப்புதல்வர்..."}, "explanation": "யுனெஸ்கோ பாராட்டுரை: 'பெரியார் - புது உலகத்தின் தொலைநோக்காளர்; தெற்கு ஆசியாவின் சாக்ரடீஸ்; சமூகச் சீர்திருத்த இயக்கத்தின் தந்தை; அறியாமை, மூடநம்பிக்கை ஆகியவற்றின் கடும் எதிரி'."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How does the renowned UNESCO citation honoring Thanthai Periyar commence?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Father of the Indian nation...", "B": "Prophet of the New Age, Socrates of South Asia, Father of Social Reform Movement...", "C": "Peace ambassador of Asia...", "D": "Noble son of Tamils..."}, "explanation": "The UNESCO citation hails Periyar as the 'Prophet of the New Age, Socrates of South Asia, Father of Social Reform Movement'."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 157, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 157", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "unesco_citation"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-social-equality-quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சாதி உணர்வு ஆதிக்க உணர்வை வளர்க்கிறது; மற்றவர்களின் உரிமைகளைப் பறிக்கிறது; மனிதர்களை இழிவுபடுத்துகிறது\" என்று முழங்கியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வ.உ.சி", "B": "ராஜாஜி", "C": "தந்தை பெரியார்", "D": "சுப்பிரமணிய பாரதியார்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில் பெரியாரின் பொன்மொழியாக: 'சாதி உணர்வு ஆதிக்க உணர்வை வளர்க்கிறது. மற்றவர்களின் உரிமைகளைப் பறிக்கிறது. மனிதர்களை இழிவுபடுத்துகிறது. அந்தச் சாதி என்ற கட்டமைப்பை உடைத்தெறிய வேண்டும்' எனக் கூறப்பட்டுள்ளது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"Caste consciousness fosters oppressive hegemony, robs others of their human rights, and degrades humanity\" - Who proclaimed this?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "V.O.C", "B": "Rajaji", "C": "Thanthai Periyar (தந்தை பெரியார்)", "D": "Subramanya Bharathiyar"}, "explanation": "Periyar emphasized that caste is an engine of inequality that systematically destroys human empathy and dignity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 155, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 155", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "quote"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q028", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-impact-modern-tamilnadu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தற்காலத் தமிழ்நாட்டில் சமூக நீதி, கல்வி வளர்ச்சி, பெண் உரிமை ஆகியவற்றில் ஏற்பட்டுள்ள மாபெரும் மறுமலர்ச்சிக்கு வித்திட்ட சிந்தனையாளர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆங்கிலேய ஆளுநர்கள்", "B": "நிலப்பிரபுக்கள்", "C": "மன்னர்கள்", "D": "தந்தை பெரியார்"}, "explanation": "தமிழகத்தில் ஏற்பட்ட சுயமரியாதை விழிப்புணர்வு, இடஒதுக்கீடு சட்டம், பெண்களுக்கான சொத்துரிமைச் சட்டம், சமூகநீதி ஆகிய அனைத்துக்கும் தந்தை பெரியாரின் சிந்தனைகளே அடித்தளமாக அமைந்தன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whose transformative intellectual and social crusade laid the foundational bedrock for modern Tamil Nadu's social justice, female empowerment, and education?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Colonial governors", "B": "Feudal landlords", "C": "Feudal kings", "D": "Thanthai Periyar (தந்தை பெரியார்)"}, "explanation": "Periyar's relentless social justice movement reshaped modern Tamil Nadu into a pioneering progressive welfare state."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 154, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 154", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "modern_renaissance"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}

