{"id": "9th-u8-q036", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-magazines-matching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக (பெரியாரின் இதழ்கள் - தன்மைகள்):\n(a) குடியரசு - 1. சமூக ஆய்விதழ்\n(b) விடுதலை - 2. புகழ்பெற்ற ஆங்கில இதழ்\n(c) ரிவோல்ட் - 3. நாளிதழ்\n(d) உண்மை - 4. 1925-ல் தொடங்கப்பட்ட முதன்மை வார இதழ்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "குடியரசு = 1925-ல் தொடங்கப்பட்ட வார இதழ் (4); விடுதலை = நாளிதழ் (3); ரிவோல்ட் = ஆங்கில இதழ் (2); உண்மை = சமூக சிந்தனை இதழ் (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match Periyar's periodicals with their respective publication types:\n(a) Kudi Arasu - 1. Social thought journal\n(b) Viduthalai - 2. Renowned English periodical\n(c) Revolt - 3. Daily newspaper\n(d) Unmai - 4. Primary weekly launched in 1925", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "Kudi Arasu -> 1925 weekly (4); Viduthalai -> Daily (3); Revolt -> English journal (2); Unmai -> Social journal (1). Sequence: 4, 3, 2, 1."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 156, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 156", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "periodicals_matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q037", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-century-celebration-1978", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "1978-ஆம் ஆண்டு தமிழ்நாடு அரசு பெரியாரின் எத்தனையாவது பிறந்தநாள் நினைவாக அவரது எழுத்துச் சீர்திருத்தத்தை நடைமுறைப்படுத்தியது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நூற்றாண்டு விழா (100-வது ஆண்டு)", "B": "பவள விழா (75-வது ஆண்டு)", "C": "பொன் விழா (50-வது ஆண்டு)", "D": "வைர விழா (60-வது ஆண்டு)"}, "explanation": "தந்தை பெரியார் பிறந்த (1879) நூற்றாண்டு விழாவான 1978-ஆம் ஆண்டில் தமிழ்நாடு அரசு பெரியாரின் எழுத்துச் சீர்திருத்தத்தை ஏற்று நடைமுறைப்படுத்தியது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "On the occasion of which jubilee anniversary of Periyar in 1978 did the Tamil Nadu Government implement his Tamil script reforms?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Birth Centenary (நூற்றாண்டு விழா - 100th birth anniversary)", "B": "Platinum Jubilee", "C": "Golden Jubilee", "D": "Diamond Jubilee"}, "explanation": "Periyar's birth centenary year (1978-1979) was commemorated by the state government adopting his modernized orthography."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educ