{"id": "9th-u8-q049", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-communal-order-history", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "இந்திய அரசியலமைப்பின் முதல் சட்டத்திருத்தம் (1951) பிற்படுத்தப்பட்டோரின் கல்வி, வேலைவாய்ப்பு இடஒதுக்கீட்டைப் பாதுகாக்க வரக் காரணமான போராட்டம் யாருடையது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தந்தை பெரியாரின் தமிழக அளவிலான தீவிரப் போராட்டம்", "B": "ஆங்கிலேயரின் திட்டம்", "C": "ஜமீன்தார்களின் கோரிக்கை", "D": "வணிகர் சங்கங்களின் போராட்டம்"}, "explanation": "வகுப்புவாரி இடஒதுக்கீடு செல்லாது என நீதிமன்றம் தீர்ப்பளித்த போது, தந்தை பெரியார் தமிழகமெங்கும் நடத்திய மாபெரும் கிளர்ச்சியால்தான் நேரு தலைமையிலான மத்திய அரசு இந்திய அரசியலமைப்பில் முதல் சட்டத்திருத்தத்தைக் கொண்டுவந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whose agitations compelled the First Constitutional Amendment (1951) protecting affirmative action reservations for backward classes?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Thanthai Periyar's statewide mass agitation across Tamil Nadu", "B": "British colonial drafting", "C": "Zamindars' petitions", "D": "Merchant guilds"}, "explanation": "Periyar's mass rallies forced the central government to enact the First Amendment to the Constitution of India in 1951 protecting reservations."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 155, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 155", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "periyar", "first_amendment"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q050", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "periyar-self-respect-slogan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"சுயமரியாதை இல்லாத மனிதன் வெறும் பிணம்\" என்று மனித மாண்பை முதன்மைப்படுத்தியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "காமராசர்", "B": "தந்தை பெரியார்", "C": "வ.உ.சி", "D": "பாரதிதாசன்"}, "explanation": "மனிதனுக்கு மானமும் சுயமரியாதையுமே முதன்மையானது; சுயமரியாதை இல்லாத மனிதன் உயிருடன் இருந்தும் பிணத்திற்கு ஒப்பாவான் என்று பெரியார் முழங்கினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"A human being devoid of self-respect is a mere living corpse\" - Who proclaimed this to dignify human worth?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kamarajar", "B": "Thanthai Periyar (தந்தை பெரியார்)", "C": "V.O.C", "D": "Bharathidasan"}, "explanation": "Periyar proclaimed that self-respect is the paramount attribute of human dignity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 154, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 154", "url": null, "sourc