{"id": "9th-u8-q063", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "lao-tzu-tao-te-ching", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'தாவோ தே ஜிங்' (Tao Te Ching) என்னும் மெய்யியல் நூலை இயற்றிய சீனத் தத்துவஞானி யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கன்ஃபூசியஸ்", "B": "மென்சியஸ்", "C": "லா வோட்சு (Lao Tzu)", "D": "சுவாங் சூ"}, "explanation": "'தாவோ தே ஜிங்' என்னும் உலகப் புகழ் பெற்ற தத்துவ நூலை இயற்றியவர் சீன மெய்யியலாளரான லா வோட்சு ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who is the ancient Chinese philosopher-mystic who authored the timeless philosophical classic 'Tao Te Ching'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Confucius", "B": "Mencius", "C": "Lao Tzu (லா வோட்சு)", "D": "Zhuangzi"}, "explanation": "Lao Tzu authored the foundational philosophical text 'Tao Te Ching', establishing Taoism."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "lao_tzu", "tao_te_ching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q064", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "lao-tzu-century-contemporary", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாவோயியத்தை நிறுவிய லா வோட்சு வாழ்ந்த காலம் மற்றும் அவருடைய சமகாலத்தவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கி.மு. முதலாம் நூற்றாண்டு, சாணக்கியர்", "B": "கி.பி. இரண்டாம் நூற்றாண்டு, திருவள்ளுவர்", "C": "கி.மு. மூன்றாம் நூற்றாண்டு, அசோகர்", "D": "கி.மு. ஆறாம் நூற்றாண்டு; கன்ஃபூசியஸின் சமகாலத்தவர்"}, "explanation": "லா வோட்சு கி.மு. (பொ.ஆ.மு.) ஆறாம் நூற்றாண்டைச் சேர்ந்தவர். இவர் மற்றொரு புகழ்பெற்ற சீன ஞானியான கன்ஃபூசியஸின் சமகாலத்தவர் ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "To which century did Lao Tzu belong, and who was his celebrated philosophical contemporary?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1st Century BCE, Chanakya", "B": "2nd Century CE, Thiruvalluvar", "C": "3rd Century BCE, Ashoka", "D": "6th Century BCE; Contemporary of Confucius (கி.மு. 6-ஆம் நூற்றாண்டு, கன்ஃபூசியஸ்)"}, "explanation": "Lao Tzu lived in 6th Century BCE China as an elder contemporary of Confucius."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "lao_tzu", "period"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q065", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tao-te-ching-wheel-spoke", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "லா வோட்சுவின் பாடலில், 'சக்கரத்தின் முப்பது ஆரக்கால்கள் நடுக்குடத்தில் இணைந்தாலும், எதன் காரணமாகச் சக்கரம் சுழல்கிறது?' என்று கேட்கிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நடுவில் உள்ள வெற்றிடத்தால் (மைய வெற்றிடம்)", "B": "மரத்தின் வலிமையால்", "C": "இரும்பின் எடையால்", "D": "குதிரையின் வேகத்தால்"}, "explanation": "'ஆரக்கால்கள் முப்பது ஒரு சக்கரத்தின் குடத்தில் இணைகின்றன; ஆயினும் நடுவில் உள்ள வெற்றிடமே சக்கரத்தைச் சுழலச் செய்கிறது' என்று பயன்பாட்டில் வெற்றிடத்தின் முக்கியத்துவத்தை லா வோட்சு விளக்குகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Lao Tzu's verse, although thirty spokes converge at the hub of a chariot wheel, what element makes the wheel function?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The hollow emptiness/void in the center (நடுவில் உள்ள வெற்றிடம்)", "B": "The strength of timber", "C": "The weight of iron", "D": "The speed of the horse"}, "explanation": "Lao Tzu illustrates that the empty space within the hub enables the axle to turn, rendering the wheel usable."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "tao_te_ching", "wheel_metaphor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q066", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tao-te-ching-clay-pot", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "களிமண்ணால் பாண்டம் (குடம்) செய்யும்போது அதன் பயனாவது எதனால் ஏற்படுவதாக லா வோட்சு குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வண்ணப் பூச்சினால்", "B": "பாண்டத்தின் உள்ளே இருக்கும் வெற்றிடத்தினால்", "C": "மண்ணின் மணத்தினால்", "D": "குடத்தின் கனத்தினால்"}, "explanation": "'களிமண்ணால் பாண்டம் செய்யப்படுகிறது; ஆயினும் உள்ளிருக்கும் வெற்றிடமே பாண்டத்தைப் பயன்படுத்த உதவுகிறது' என்கிறார் லா வோட்சு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When clay is molded into a hollow vessel, what intrinsic quality makes the pot functionally useful?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "External glaze painting", "B": "The inner hollow space/emptiness within it (உள்ளிருக்கும் வெற்றிடம்)", "C": "The earthy scent of clay", "D": "The thickness of the pot"}, "explanation": "Clay shapes the pot, but the empty space inside holds water, demonstrating the power of the non-existent void."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "tao_te_ching", "pot_metaphor"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q067", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tao-philosophy-form-and-void", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாவோ தே ஜிங் கவிதையின் தலையாய மெய்யியல் முடிவு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பொருள் மட்டுமே நிரந்தரமானது", "B": "வெற்றிடம் பயனற்றது", "C": "உருவமுடையவை பயன்பாட்டைத் தருகின்றன; ஆயினும் உருவமற்ற வெற்றிடமே அப்பயன்பாட்டைச் சாத்தியமாக்குகிறது", "D": "அறிவியல் பொய்யானது"}, "explanation": "'உருவம் உடையவை பயன் தருகின்றன; உருவமற்றவையே அந்தப் பயன்பாட்டைச் செயல்படுத்துகின்றன' (Being gives usefulness, but Non-being gives function) என்பதே தாவோயியத்தின் அடிப்படைத் தத்துவமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the profound philosophical deduction of the Tao Te Ching verses?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Material substance alone is eternal", "B": "Void is useless", "C": "Form/Being (உருவம்) provides utility, yet the Formless Void/Non-being (வெற்றிடம்) realizes that utility", "D": "Science is illusory"}, "explanation": "Taoism teaches that tangible forms create possibility, but the intangible void actualizes true usefulness."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_8", "tao_te_ching", "philosophy"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u8-q068", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u8", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u8-l2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tao-te-ching-tamil-translator", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பாடப்பகுதியில் உள்ள 'தாவோ தே ஜிங்' கவிதையைத் தமிழில் மொழிபெயர்த்தவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மு. சிவலிங்கம்", "B": "ந. பிச்சமூர்த்தி", "C": "சுஜாதா", "D": "சி. மணி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள லா வோட்சுவின் தாவோ தே ஜிங் கவிதையைத் தமிழில் மொழியாக்கம் செய்தவர் புகழ்பெற்ற கவிஞர் 'சி. மணி' ஆவார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who translated Lao Tzu's Tao Te Ching verses into Tamil as presented in the textbook?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mu. Sivalingam", "B": "Na. Pitchamurthi", "C": "Sujatha", "D": "C. Mani (சி. மணி)"}, "explanation": "Eminent modern poet C. Mani translated Lao Tzu's Tao Te Ching into Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 169, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 169", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": n