{"id": "9th-u9-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "conceptual", "level": "analysis", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "aalumaai-stages-evolution", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தனிநாயக அடிகளின் கூற்றுப்படி, ஒரு மனிதனின் ஆளுமை முழுமை பெறுவதற்கு எவ்வகை எல்லைகளை அவன் கடக்க வேண்டும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சுயநலம், குடும்பம், இனம், மொழி, நாடு ஆகிய எல்லைகளைக் கடந்து உலக மாந்தர் அனைவரையும் நேசிக்கும் நிலையை அடைதல்", "B": "தன்னுடைய நாட்டையும் மொழியையும் மட்டுமே போற்றுதல்", "C": "பிற சமயங்களையும் நாகரிகங்களையும் நிராகரித்தல்", "D": "பொருளாதார மேன்மையை மட்டுமே மனித வாழ்வின் குறிக்கோளாகக் கொள்ளுதல்"}, "explanation": "பாடப்பகுதி விளக்கம்: முதிர்ந்த ஆளுமை என்பது குறுகிய வட்டங்களான தன்னலம், சாதி, இனம், நாடு ஆகியவற்றைக் கடந்து உலகம் தழுவிய மானுட நேயத்தை எய்துவதாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Father Thaninayagam, how does a human being attain full psychological and ethical maturity in personality?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "By transcending selfish interests, tribe, language, and nation to embrace universal love for all humanity", "B": "By praising only one's own insular nation and language", "C": "By rejecting outside faiths and civilizations", "D": "By pursuing wealth accumulation as the sole ambition"}, "explanation": "Mature personality involves breaking insular boundaries to achieve universal empathy."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 173, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 173", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "aalumaai", "maturity"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "comprehension", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sangam-literature-chivalry-character", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க இலக்கியப் புறநானூற்றில் சான்றோனின் கடமையாகக் குறிப்பிடப்படும் ஆளுமைப் பண்பு எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "'ஈன்று புறந்தருதல் எந்தைக்குக் கடனே'", "B": "'சான்றோன் ஆக்குதல் தந்தைக்குக் கடனே' (பொன்முடியார்)", "C": "'களிறு எறிந்து பெயர்தல் காளைக்குக் கடனே'", "D": "'ஒளிறுவாள் அருஞ்சமம் தட்டல் வேந்தற்குக் கடனே'"}, "explanation": "சங்கப் புலவர் பொன்முடியார் புறநானூற்றில் (பாடல் 312), மகனை நற்பண்புகள் நிறைந்த 'சான்றோன் ஆக்குதல் தந்தைக்குக் கடனே' என்று ஆளுமை உருவாக்கத்தில் தந்தையின் பொறுப்பைச் சுட்டுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which character-building duty of a father towards his son is famously recorded by poet Ponmudiyar in Purananuru?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Giving birth and nurturing is the mother's duty", "B": "'Saandron aakkuthal thanthaikku kadanae' (Molding him into an exemplary gentleman is the father's duty)", "C": "Slaying the elephant is the warrior youth's duty", "D": "Displaying valiant swordplay is the king's duty"}, "explanation": "Ponmudiyar highlights that shaping a child into an upright scholar-gentleman (Saandron) is a father's foremost responsibility."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 174, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 174", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["9th_tamil", "iyal_9", "purananuru", "saandron"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T09:50:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "9th-u9-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "factual", "level": "knowledge", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "9", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "9th-tamil-u9", "lesson_id": "9th-tamil-u9-l1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thaninayagam-third-conference-paris", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மூன்றாவது உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மாநாடு 1970-ஆம் ஆண்டு எந்த ஐரோப்பிய நகரத்தில் நடைபெற்றது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "லண்டன் (இங்கிலாந்து)", "B": "ரோம் (இத்தாலி)", "C": "பாரிஸ் (பிரான்ஸ்)", "D": "ஜெனீவா (சுவிட்சர்லாந்து)"}, "explanation": "1970-ஆம் ஆண்டு பிரான்ஸ் நாட்டின் தலைநகரான பாரிசில் மூன்றாவது உலகத் தமிழாராய்ச்சி மாநாடு தனிநாயகம் அடிகளாரின் வழிகாட்டுதலில் வெற்றிகரமாக நடைபெற்றது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which European metropolis was the Third World Tamil Conference hosted in 1970?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "London (England)", "B": "Rome (Italy)", "C": "Paris (France - பாரிஸ்)", "D": "Geneva (Switzerland)"}, "explanation": "The 3rd World Tamil Conference convened in Paris, France in 1970."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "9", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 176, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "9th Tamil, Unit 1, Page 176", "url": n