{"id": "10th-u4-q117", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "vinnaith_thaandiya_thannambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "birth_death_coincidence", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஸ்டீபன் ஹாக்கிங்கின் பிறப்பும் இறப்பும் எந்த இரு மாபெரும் விஞ்ஞானிகளோடு ஆச்சரியமான தொடர்புடையது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கலீலியோவின் நினைவு நாளில் பிறந்து, ஐன்ஸ்டைனின் பிறந்த நாளில் மறைந்தார்", "B": "நியூட்டன் நாளில் பிறந்து, டார்வின் நாளில் மறைந்தார்", "C": "எடிசன் நாளில் பிறந்து, டெஸ்லா நாளில் மறைந்தார்", "D": "ராமன் நாளில் பிறந்து, போஸ் நாளில் மறைந்தார்"}, "explanation": "கலீலியோவின் நினைவு நாளான 1942 ஜனவரி 8-இல் ஹாக்கிங் பிறந்தார்; ஐன்ஸ்டைனின் பிறந்த நாளான (பை தினம்) 2018 மார்ச் 14-இல் மறைந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What remarkable historical cosmic coincidence marks Stephen Hawking’s birth and death dates?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Born on the death anniversary of Galileo (Jan 8), died on the birth anniversary of Einstein (March 14 / Pi Day)", "B": "Born on Newton’s day, died on Darwin’s", "C": "Born on Edison’s day, died on Tesla’s", "D": "Born on Raman’s day, died on Bose’s"}, "explanation": "He was born exactly on Galileo’s death anniversary and passed away on Einstein’s birth anniversary."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 81, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 81", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["விண்ணைத் தாண்டிய தன்னம்பிக்கை", "கலீலியோ", "ஐன்ஸ்டைன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q118", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "vinnaith_thaandiya_thannambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "paralympics_2012", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "2012-ஆம் ஆண்டில் நடைபெற்ற எந்த உலக விளையாட்டுப் போட்டியின் தொடக்க விழாவில் ஸ்டீபன் ஹாக்கிங் முதன்மை விருந்தினராகப் பங்கேற்றார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆசிய விளையாட்டுப் போட்டிகள்", "B": "இலண்டன் பாராலிம்பிக்ஸ் மாற்றுத்திறனாளிகள் விளையாட்டுப் போட்டி", "C": "காமன்வெல்த் போட்டிகள்", "D": "விண்டர் ஒலிம்பிக்ஸ்"}, "explanation": "2012 இலண்டன் மாற்றுத்திறனாளிகளுக்கான பாராலிம்பிக்ஸ் விளையாட்டுப் போட்டியின் தொடக்க விழாவில் ஹாக்கிங் பங்கேற்றுப் பேருரையாற்றினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "At the grand opening ceremony of which premier world sporting event in 2012 was Stephen Hawking the guest of honor?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Asian Games", "B": "London Paralympic Games", "C": "Commonwealth Games", "D": "Winter Olympics"}, "explanation": "He addressed the world at the opening ceremony of the London 2012 Paralympic Games."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 83", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["விண்ணைத் தாண்டிய தன்னம்பிக்கை", "பாராலிம்பிக்ஸ்", "2012"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q119", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "vinnaith_thaandiya_thannambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "speech_device", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முழுமையாகப் பேசும் திறனை இழந்த ஸ்டீபன் ஹாக்கிங் உலகோடு உரையாட உதவிய கணினி சாதனம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒலிவாங்கி", "B": "மின்னஞ்சல்", "C": "கன்னத் தசை அசைவு சென்சாரும், கணினி குரல் தொகுப்பியும் (Speech Synthesizer)", "D": "தொலைபேசி"}, "explanation": "கன்னத்து தசையின் சிறு அசைவை சென்சார்கள் உணர்ந்து கணினித் திரையில் எழுத்துகளைத் தேர்வு செய்து, ஸ்பீச் சிந்தசைசர் வழியே ஹாக்கிங் பேசினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which cutting-edge assistive technology enabled the fully paralyzed Stephen Hawking to communicate thoughts to the world?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Standard mic", "B": "Email box", "C": "Infrared cheek-muscle switch sensors coupled with a computerized Speech Synthesizer", "D": "Rotary telephone"}, "explanation": "An infrared cheek-muscle sensor driving a predictive speech synthesizer synthesized his voice."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 82, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 4, Page 82", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["விண்ணைத் தாண்டிய தன்னம்பிக்கை", "குரல் தொகுப்பி", "Speech Synthesizer"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u4-q120", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "vinnaith_thaandiya_thannambikkai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "hawking_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"தலைவிதிதான் வாழ்க்கையைத் தீர்மானிக்கிறது என்றால், சாலையைக் கடக்கும் போது இருபுறமும் ஏன் பார்க்க வேண்டும்?\" என்று நகைச்சுவையாகக் கேட்டவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அப்துல் கலாம்", "B": "ஐன்ஸ்டைன்", "C": "கலிலியோ", "D": "ஸ்டீபன் ஹாக்கிங்"}, "explanation": "ஸ்டீபன் ஹாக்கிங் தலைவிதியை மட்டுமே நம்பி முடங்கிக் கிடப்பவர்களை நோக்கி இவ்வாறு நகைச்சுவையாகவும் சிந்திக்கத்தக்க வகையிலும் கூறினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who wryly quipped: \"I have noticed that even those who assert that everything is fated still look both ways before they cross the street\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "A. P. J. Abdul Kalam", "B": "Albert Einstein", "C": "Galileo", "D": "Stephen Hawking"}, "explanation": "Stephen Hawking famously mocked absolute fatalism with this witty observation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 83, "chapter": null, "se