{"id": "10th-u5-q042", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "mozhipeyarppuk_kalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "translation_types_jakobson", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ரோமன் ஜேகப்சன் (Roman Jakobson) முதலான மொழியியலாளர்கள் மொழிபெயர்ப்பை எத்தனை முக்கிய வகைகளாகப் பகுத்துள்ளனர்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "இரண்டு வகைகள்", "B": "மூன்று வகைகள் (உள்மொழிபெயர்ப்பு, மொழியிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு, குறியீட்டிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு)", "C": "ஐந்து வகைகள்", "D": "ஏழு வகைகள்"}, "explanation": "ரோமன் ஜேகப்சன் மொழிபெயர்ப்பை: 1. Intralingual (உள்மொழிபெயர்ப்பு), 2. Interlingual (மொழியிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு), 3. Intersemiotic (குறியீட்டிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு) என 3 வகையாகப் பிரித்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Linguist Roman Jakobson classified translation into how many cardinal categories?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Two types", "B": "Three types (Intralingual, Interlingual, and Intersemiotic)", "C": "Five types", "D": "Seven types"}, "explanation": "Jakobson proposed these 3 seminal modes of translation."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 98, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 98", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["மொழிபெயர்ப்புக் கல்வி", "ரோமன் ஜேகப்சன்", "மொழிபெயர்ப்பு வகைகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q043", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "mozhipeyarppuk_kalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "translation_interlingual", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஒரு மொழியிலிருந்து வேறொரு மொழிக்கு நூலை மாற்றி மொழிபெயர்ப்பது (எ.கா: ஆங்கிலத்திலிருந்து தமிழுக்கு) ரோமன் ஜேகப்சனின் எந்த வகைப்பாட்டிற்குள் அடங்கும்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "உள்மொழிபெயர்ப்பு (Intralingual)", "B": "குறியீட்டிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு (Intersemiotic)", "C": "மொழியிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு (Interlingual Translation)", "D": "வடிவ மொழிபெயர்ப்பு"}, "explanation": "ஒரு மொழிக் குறியீடுகளை மற்றொரு மொழிக்குள் மாற்றுவது \"மொழியிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு\" (Interlingual Translation) எனப்படும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Translating a text from one language into a totally different language (e.g. English into Tamil) is known as what in Jakobson's typology?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Intralingual translation", "B": "Intersemiotic translation", "C": "Interlingual translation (Translation proper)", "D": "Morphological coding"}, "explanation": "Interlingual translation denotes translation between two distinct verbal languages."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 98, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 5, Page 98", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["மொழிபெயர்ப்புக் கல்வி", "மொழியிடை மொழிபெயர்ப்பு", "ஜேகப்சன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u5-q044", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_5", "lesson_id": "mozhipeyarppuk_kalvi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tagore_bengali_english", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "தாகூர் தமது கீதாஞ்சலியை வங்காளத்திலிருந்து ஆங்கிலத்திற்கு மொழிபெயர்த்த போது நிகழ்ந்தது எவ்வகை மாற்றம்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "மரபுக்கவிதையை உரைநடையாக மாற்றினார்", "B": "அளவை இருமடங்காகப் பெருக்கினார்", "C": "கதாபாத்திரங்களின் பெயரை மாற்றினார்", "D": "வங்காள யாப்பு வடிவத்தை விடுத்து எளிய, இசைவான ஆங்கில உரைநடை-கவிதை (Prose-poetry) வடிவைக் கையாண்டார்"}, "explanation": "தாகூர் வங்காளப் பாடல்களை அப்படியே செய்யுளாக மாற்றாமல், உலக மக்கள் எளிதில் உணரும் வண்ணம் ஆங்கிலக் கவிதை உரைநடையில் (Prose-poetry) நளினமாகப் பெயர்த்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "When Rabindranath Tagore translated Gitanjali from Bengali into English, what stylistic transformation did he adopt?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Converted epic meter into technical prose", "B": "Doubled the textual length", "C": "Altered character identities", "D": "Adapted rigid Bengali metrical verse into rhythmic, luminous English prose-poetry"}, "explanation": "Tagore adapted his songs into evocative prose-poetry."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": 