{"id": "10th-u7-q014", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "congress_movement_entry", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் அவர்கள் எந்த மாபெரும் தேசியத் தலைவரின் கொள்கைகளால் ஈர்க்கப்பட்டு இந்திய விடுதலை இயக்கத்தில் இணைந்தார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஜவஹர்லால் நேரு", "B": "மகாத்மா காந்தியடிகள்", "C": "சுபாஷ் சந்திர போஸ்", "D": "சர்தார் வல்லபாய் படேல்"}, "explanation": "காந்தியடிகளின் சத்தியாகிரகம், எளிமை மற்றும் சுதேசி சிந்தனைகளால் ஈர்க்கப்பட்டு ம. பொ. சி இந்திய தேசிய காங்கிரஸ் இயக்கத்தில் தீவிரமாக ஈடுபட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "By which towering national leader's ideals was M. P. Sivagnanam deeply drawn to join the freedom movement?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Jawaharlal Nehru", "B": "Mahatma Gandhi", "C": "Subhas Chandra Bose", "D": "Sardar Vallabhbhai Patel"}, "explanation": "Mahatma Gandhi's ideals galvanized him into the national freedom struggle."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "மகாத்மா காந்தி", "காங்கிரஸ் இயக்கம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q015", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "books_on_silappathikaram", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் அவர்கள் சிலப்பதிகாரத்தின் பெருமையை உணர்த்த எழுதிய புகழ்பெற்ற ஆய்வு நூல்களுள் ஒன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிலம்பு தந்த பெண்", "B": "சிலப்பதிகார நாவல்", "C": "சிலப்பதிகாரமும் தமிழ்த் தேசியமும் / சிலப்பதிகார ஆய்வு நூல்கள்", "D": "மணிமேகலை விளக்கம்"}, "explanation": "ம. பொ. சி சிலப்பதிகாரத்தின் மீது பல்வேறு சொற்பொழிவுகளையும் \"சிலப்பதிகாரமும் தமிழ்த் தேசியமும்\", \"சிலப்பதிகார யாத்திரை\" முதலான அரிய ஆய்வு நூல்களையும் தந்துள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which scholarly treatise on the epic Silappathikaram was written by M. P. Sivagnanam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Silambu Thantha Pen", "B": "Silappathikara Novel", "C": "Silappathikaramum Thamizh Thesiyamum", "D": "Manimekalai Vilakkam"}, "explanation": "He authored foundational studies including \"Silappathikaramum Thamizh Thesiyamum\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 154, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 154", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "சிலப்பதிகார ஆய்வு நூல்கள்", "ம.பொ.சி படைப்பு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q016", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "education_self_effort", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வறுமையால் பள்ளிக்குச் செல்ல முடியாத ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் எத்தகைய வழியில் பேரறிஞராக உயர்ந்தார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வெளிநாட்டுப் பல்கலைக்கழகப் படிப்பால்", "B": "அரசாங்க உதவித்தொகையால்", "C": "செல்வந்தர்களின் கொடையால்", "D": "தனி மனிதத் தன்னம்பிக்கை, தீவிர வாசிப்பு மற்றும் அச்சுக்கூட அனுபவத்தால் சுயமுயற்சியோடு கற்று உயர்ந்தார்"}, "explanation": "ம. பொ. சி ஏழ்மையை வென்று தன் அயராத நூல் வாசிப்பாலும் உழைப்பாலும் தமிழறிஞராகவும் சட்டமன்றத் தலைவராகவும் உயர்ந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In what inspiring manner did M. P. Sivagnanam elevate himself into a peerless scholar despite dropping out in 3rd standard?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Foreign university degrees", "B": "State scholarships", "C": "Patronage of oligarchs", "D": "Indomitable self-reliance, voracious reading, and relentless intellectual self-cultivation"}, "explanation": "He exemplified triumph over adversity through voracious self-guided scholarship."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 150, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 150", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "சுயமுயற்சி", "தன்னம்பிக்கை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q017", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "chapter_nature_autobiography", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "10-ஆம் வகுப்பு இயல் 7 உரைநடைப் பகுதியான \"சிற்றகல் ஒளி\" எவ்வகை இலக்கிய வடிவத்தைச் சார்ந்தது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தன்வரலாற்று உரைநடை (Autobiography)", "B": "பயண இலக்கியம்", "C": "நாடக வடிவம்", "D": "கடித இலக்கியம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூலில் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள \"சிற்றகல் ஒளி\" ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் அவர்களின் தன்வரலாற்று நூலான \"எனது போராட்டம்\" நூலின் தொகுப்பாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What literary genre does the prose chapter \"Sitragal Oli\" represent in Tamil literature?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Autobiographical prose (Thanvaralaaru)", "B": "Travelogue literature", "C": "Dramatic script", "D": "Epistolary letters"}, "explanation": "It is an autobiographical memoir drawn from his book \"Enathu Poraattam\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 150, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 150", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "இலக்கிய வகை", "தன்வரலாறு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q018", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "thamizharasu_kazhagam_objective", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் தமிழரசுக் கழகத்தை நிறுவியதன் முதன்மை நோக்கம் என்ன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "திரைப்படங்களைத் தயாரிப்பது", "B": "தமிழகத்தின் எல்லைகளைப் பாதுகாப்பதும், தமிழர்களின் மொழி, பண்பாட்டு உரிமைகளை வென்றெடுப்பதும்", "C": "வெளிநாட்டு வணிகம் செய்வது", "D": "சட்டமன்றத் தேர்தலை மட்டும் சந்திப்பது"}, "explanation": "மொழிவாரி மாநிலங்கள் அமைக்கப்பட்ட காலத்தில் தமிழகத்தின் எல்லைகளைக் காத்து, தமிழர்களின் சுயமரியாதையையும் உரிமைகளையும் பாதுகாப்பதே தமிழரசுக் கழகத்தின் லட்சியமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the primary patriotic objective behind M. P. Sivagnanam founding the Thamizharasu Kazhagam?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Producing commercial cinema", "B": "Defending the territorial borders of Tamil Nadu and securing linguistic-cultural rights for Tamils", "C": "Foreign commerce", "D": "Electoral politics alone"}, "explanation": "Defending territorial integrity and linguistic rights was its core mission."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 151, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 151", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "தமிழரசுக் கழகம் நோக்கம்", "எல்லைப் பாதுகாப்பு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kattabomman_history_propagation", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் அவர்கள் விடுதலைப் போராட்ட வீரரான வீரபாண்டிய கட்டபொம்மனின் வீர வரலாற்றை மக்களுக்கு உணர்த்த ஆற்றிய தொண்டு யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கட்டபொம்மன் வரலாற்றைத் திரைப்படமாகத் தயாரித்தது மட்டுமே", "B": "கட்டபொம்மன் சிலையைக் கடலில் கரைத்தது", "C": "\"வீரபாண்டிய கட்டபொம்மன்\" என்னும் வரலாற்று நூலை எழுதி, கயத்தாறில் அவருக்கு நினைவுச் சின்னம் எழுப்பக் காரணமாக இருந்தது", "D": "ஆங்கிலேயரின் ஆட்சியை ஆதரித்தது"}, "explanation": "ம. பொ. சி வீரபாண்டிய கட்டபொம்மன் மற்றும் வ. உ. சிதம்பரனாரின் வரலாறுகளை நூல்களாக எழுதித் தமிழக மக்களின் தேசிய உணர்வைத் தட்டி எழுப்பினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How did M. P. Sivagnanam resurrect the heroic legacy of Veerapandiya Kattabomman in modern Tamil consciousness?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Directing commercial movies only", "B": "Immersing his statue at sea", "C": "Writing his historical biography and pioneering the memorial monument at Kayatharu", "D": "Supporting colonial rule"}, "explanation": "He wrote Kattabomman's biography and spearheaded the memorial at Kayatharu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 154, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 154", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "வீரபாண்டிய கட்டபொம்மன்", "கயத்தாறு நினைவுச்சின்னம்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "voc_biography_kappalottiya_thamizhan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "வ. உ. சிதம்பரனாரின் தியாக வாழ்வைப் போற்றி \"கப்பலோட்டிய தமிழன்\" என்னும் நூலை இயற்றி மக்களுக்கு விழிப்புணர்வு ஊட்டியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "நாமக்கல் கவிஞர்", "B": "திரு. வி. கலியாணசுந்தரனார்", "C": "பாரதியார்", "D": "ம. பொ. சிவஞானம்"}, "explanation": "வ. உ. சி-யின் தியாகத்தை \"கப்பலோட்டிய தமிழன்\" என்னும் புகழ்பெற்ற நூலின் வழியாக உலகறியச் செய்த பெருமை ம. பொ. சி-க்கு உண்டு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who authored the celebrated biography titled \"Kappalottiya Thamizhan\" commemorating V. O. Chidambaram Pillai?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Namakkal Kavignar", "B": "Thiru. Vi. Ka.", "C": "Mahakavi Bharathiyar", "D": "M. P. Sivagnanam (Ma. Po. Si.)"}, "explanation": "M. P. Sivagnanam wrote the inspiring book \"Kappalottiya Thamizhan\"."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 154, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 154", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["சிற்றகல் ஒளி", "கப்பலோட்டிய தமிழன்", "ம.பொ.சி நூல்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u7-q021", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mother_tongue_pride", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"செந்தமிழும் நாப்பழக்கம்; தாய்ப்பால் வழியே தாய்மொழி உணர்வைப் பெற வேண்டும்\" என்று ம. பொ. சிவஞானம் வலியுறுத்தியது எதனை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தாய்மொழி வழிக் கல்வி மற்றும் தாய்மொழிப் பற்றின் இன்றியமையாமை", "B": "அயல்நாட்டு மொழிக் கல்வி மட்டுமே நன்று", "C": "பழைய மொழிகளைப் புறக்கணிப்பது", "D": "எழுத்துக்களைக் கற்காமல் இருப்பது"}, "explanation": "ம. பொ. சி தமிழர்கள் அனைவரும் தாய்மொழியில் கல்வி கற்க வேண்டும் என்றும், தாய்மொழியே சிந்தனை வளர்ச்சிக்கு அடிப்படை என்றும் வலியுறுத்தினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What foundational educational philosophy was championed by M. P. Sivagnanam through mother tongue advocacy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The indispensability of mother tongue medium education and pride in Tamil", "B": "Foreign medium exclusively", "C": "Discarding classical heritage", "D": "Illiteracy endorsement"}, "explanation": "He championed mother tongue education as essential for intellectual empowerment."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Tex