{"id": "10th-u7-q041", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sitragal_oli", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "vengadam_kumari_sangam_quote", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"வடவேங்கடம் தென்குமரி ஆயிடைத் தமிழ்கூறும் நல்லுலகத்து...\" - என்ற வரிகள் இடம்பெற்றுள்ள பழம்பெரும் இலக்கண நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தொல்காப்பியம் (பனம்பாரனார் பாயிரம்)", "B": "நன்னூல்", "C": "வீரசோழியம்", "D": "யாப்பருங்கலக்காரிகை"}, "explanation": "தொல்காப்பியப் பாயிரத்தில் பனம்பாரனார் தமிழகத்தின் இயற்கை எல்லைகளாக வடக்கே வேங்கட மலையையும் தெற்கே குமரி முனையையும் குறிப்பிட்டுள்ளார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which ancient grammatical text defines the frontiers of Tamilakam with the verse \"Vada Vengadam Then Kumari aayidai Thamizh koorum nallulagathu...\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Tholkappiyam (Panambaranar Paayiram)", "B": "Nannool", "C": "Veerasozhiyam", "D": "Yaapparungalakkaarigai"}, "explanation": "Tholkappiyam Panambaranar Paayiram defines the traditional borders of Tamilakam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page":