{"id": "10th-u9-q019", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "quote_thannarivu", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"என்னை முதன்முதலில் அறிந்து கொண்டவன் நானே... என்னைச் செதுக்கிய சிற்பியும் நானே!\" - என்று தன் சுய அடையாளத்தை கம்பீரமாகப் பிரகடனம் செய்தவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கண்ணதாசன்", "B": "வைரமுத்து", "C": "ஜெயகாந்தன்", "D": "வாலி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: தன் சுய ஆளுமையையும் சுதந்திரச் சிந்தனையையும் பெருமிதத்தோடு பறைசாற்றியவர் ஜெயகாந்தன்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who famously stated: \"I was the first to discover myself... I am the sculptor who carved my own being!\"?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kannadasan", "B": "Vairamuthu", "C": "Jayakanthan", "D": "Vaali"}, "explanation": "Jayakanthan declared this fiercely independent self-realization."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 198, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 198", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஜெயகாந்தன்", "தன்னறிதல்", "மேற்கோள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "translations_russian_french", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஜெயகாந்தனின் படைப்புகள் எந்தெந்த உலக மொழிகளில் மொழிபெயர்க்கப்பட்டுப் பெருமை பெற்றுள்ளன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீன மற்றும் ஜப்பானிய மொழிகளில் மட்டும்", "B": "அரபு மொழியில் மட்டும்", "C": "கிரேக்க மொழியில் மட்டும்", "D": "ஆங்கிலம், இந்தி, ஜெர்மன், பிரெஞ்சு, உருசிய உள்ளிட்ட பல மொழிகளில்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: ஜெயகாந்தனின் சிறுகதைகளும் நாவல்களும் ஆங்கிலம் மட்டுமன்றி உருசியம், உக்ரைனியன், பிரெஞ்சு, ஜெர்மன் உள்ளிட்ட உலக மொழிகளிலும் மொழிபெயர்க்கப்பட்டுள்ளன."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Into which world languages have Jayakanthan's literary masterpieces been translated?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Chinese and Japanese only", "B": "Arabic only", "C": "Greek only", "D": "English, Hindi, German, French, and Russian among others"}, "explanation": "Translated into multiple Indian and world languages including Russian and French."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_y