{"id": "10th-u9-q025", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_jnanpith_writers", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] தமிழில் இதுவரை ஞானபீட விருது பெற்ற இரு பெரும் படைப்பாளர்கள் யார் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அகிலன் (1975), ஜெயகாந்தன் (2002)", "B": "பாரதியார், பாரதிதாசன்", "C": "கல்கி, புதுமைப்பித்தன்", "D": "கண்ணதாசன், வைரமுத்து"}, "explanation": "TNPSC வினா: தமிழில் ஞானபீட விருது பெற்றவர்கள் அகிலன் (சித்திரப்பாவை - 1975) மற்றும் ஜெயகாந்தன் (2002) ஆகிய இருவர் மட்டுமே."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Who are the only two Tamil authors who have received the prestigious Jnanpith Award to date?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Akilan (1975) and Jayakanthan (2002)", "B": "Bharathiyar and Bharathidasan", "C": "Kalki and Pudhumaipithan", "D": "Kannadasan and Vairamuthu"}, "explanation": "Akilan (1975) and Jayakanthan (2002) are the two Jnanpith laureates in Tamil."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 199, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 199", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["TNPSC PYQ", "ஞானபீட விருது", "அகிலன் ஜெயகாந்தன்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q026", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஜெயகாந்தன் பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. 1972-இல் சில நேரங்களில் சில மனிதர்கள் புதினத்திற்குச் சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றார்.\n2. 2002-இல் ஞானபீட விருது பெற்றார்.\n3. இவர் சோவியத் நாட்டின் நேரு விருதைப் பெறவில்லை.\nஇவற்றுள் தவறான கூற்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 மட்டும்", "B": "3 மட்டும் (தவறு: இமயத்துக்கு அப்பால் நூலுக்காக நேரு விருது பெற்றார்)", "C": "2 மட்டும்", "D": "1 மற்றும் 2"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: ஜெயகாந்தன் சோவியத் ஒன்றியத்தின் நேரு விருதினைப் பெற்றவர். எனவே கூற்று 3 தவறானது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Examine statements on Jayakanthan: 1. Won Sahitya Akademi in 1972. 2. Won Jnanpith in 2002. 3. Never received the Soviet Nehru Award. Which is false?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 only", "B": "3 only (False: he received Soviet Nehru award for Imayathukku Appaal)", "C": "2 only", "D": "1 and 2"}, "explanation": "Statement 3 is false as he won the Soviet Land Nehru Award."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 199, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 199", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஜெயகாந்தன்", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "தவறான கூற்று"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q027", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "jayakanthan", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "matching_jayakanthan_awards", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பொருத்துக:\nஅ) சில நேரங்களில் சில மனிதர்கள் - 1. சோவியத் நேரு விருது\nஆ) இமயத்துக்கு அப்பால் - 2. தாமரைத்திரு (2009)\nஇ) ஞானபீட விருது - 3. சாகித்திய அகாதெமி (1972)\nஈ) பத்மபூஷண் - 4. இந்திய உயரிய இலக்கிய விருது (2002)", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அ-1, ஆ-2, இ-3, ஈ-4", "B": "அ-2, ஆ-3, இ-4, ஈ-1", "C": "அ-3, ஆ-1, இ-4, ஈ-2", "D": "அ-4, ஆ-1, இ-2, ஈ-3"}, "explanation": "சரியான பொருத்தம்: சில நேரங்களில் சில மனிதர்கள் - சாகித்திய அகாதெமி (1972); இமயத்துக்கு அப்பால் - சோவியத் நேரு விருது; ஞானபீட விருது - 2002; பத்மபூஷண் - 2009."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match: a) Sila Nerangalil Sila Manithargal - 1. Soviet Nehru award b) Imayatthukku Appaal - 2. Padma Bhushan c) Jnanpith - 3. Sahitya Akademi d) Padma Bhushan - 4. Highest Indian literary award.", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "B": "a-2, b-3, c-4, d-1", "C": "a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2", "D": "a-4, b-1, c-2, d-3"}, "explanation": "Correct match is a-3, b-1, c-4, d-2."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil