{"id": "10th-u9-q100", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "statement_analysis", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்தாளர் கு. அழகிரிசாமி பற்றிய பின்வரும் கூற்றுகளை ஆராய்க:\n1. இவர் கரிசல் இலக்கியத்தின் முன்னோடியாகக் கருதப்படுகிறார்.\n2. இவரது \"அன்பளிப்பு\" சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பிற்கு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது கிடைத்தது.\n3. இவர் மலேசியாவில் \"தமிழ் நேசன்\" இதழில் பணியாற்றினார்.\nஇவற்றுள் சரியானவை எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1, 2 மட்டும்", "B": "2, 3 மட்டும்", "C": "1, 3 மட்டும்", "D": "1, 2, 3 ஆகிய அனைத்தும் சரி"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் ஆய்வு: கரிசல் முன்னோடி, அன்பளிப்பு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி, தமிழ் நேசன் ஆசிரியர் - மூன்றும் வரலாற்று உண்மைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Analyze statements on Ku. Alagirisamy: 1. Pioneer of Karisal literature. 2. Won Sahitya Akademi for Anbalippu. 3. Edited Tamil Nesan in Malaysia. Which are correct?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1 and 2 only", "B": "2 and 3 only", "C": "1 and 3 only", "D": "1, 2, and 3 - All are correct"}, "explanation": "All three statements are historically verified."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["கு. அழகிரிசாமி", "கூற்று ஆய்வு", "அனைத்தும் சரி"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q101", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "kuppusamy_dignity", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கதையில் குப்புசாமி நோயாளியாக இருந்தபோதிலும் எதனைத் தன் சுயமரியாதையாகக் கருதினான்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "பிறரிடம் கையேந்தி யாசகம் கேட்காமல், எஞ்சியிருக்கும் தன் ஆற்றலால் வாழ நினைப்பது", "B": "பணக்காரர்களிடம் சண்டையிடுவது", "C": "மருத்துவரை ஏமாற்றுவது", "D": "வீட்டைப் பூட்டிக்கொள்வது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: கொடிய வறுமையிலும் தன்மானத்தோடு வாழ்ந்து, தனக்குக் கிடைத்த சொற்ப உணவிலும் பிற உயிர்களுக்குப் பகிர்ந்து தரும் உயரிய பண்பு அவனிடம் மிளிர்ந்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Despite his dire illness, what formed Kuppusamy's unwavering sense of personal self-respect?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Refusing to beg and preserving moral dignity while sharing whatever little he had", "B": "Fighting with the wealthy", "C": "Cheating doctors", "D": "Locking himself away"}, "explanation": "Preserving human dignity without begging and sharing meager food."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 206, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 206", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்", "சுயமரியாதை", "குப்புசாமி மாண்பு"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q102", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "moral_lesson", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "\"ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்\" சிறுகதை மனித குலத்திற்கு உணர்த்தும் உன்னத வாழ்வியல் அறம் யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "செல்வம் மட்டுமே மனிதனை வாழவைக்கும்", "B": "உயிர்களிடத்தில் அன்பு செலுத்துவதும், எளிய மனிதர்களுக்கு உதவும் மனிதநேயமுமே உலகை இயக்கும் பெருங்கருணை", "C": "நோயாளிகளைத் தனிமைப்படுத்த வேண்டும்", "D": "நகர வாழ்க்கையே சிறந்தது"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் செய்தி: சுயநலமற்ற அன்பும், சக உயிர்களின் மீதான எல்லையற்ற கருணையுமே மனித வாழ்வின் உண்மையான பொருள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What quintessential life value does the story \"Oruvan Irukkiran\" impart?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Wealth alone sustains life", "B": "Selfless compassion toward all living beings and humanitarian aid to the suffering sustains the world", "C": "Sick people should be isolated", "D": "Urban life is supreme"}, "explanation": "Compassion toward suffering beings constitutes the true sustaining spirit of humanity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 206, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 206", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["ஒருவன் இருக்கிறான்", "வாழ்வியல் அறம்", "கருணை"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q104", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "life_span_alagirisamy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "எழுத்தாளர் கு. அழகிரிசாமி வாழ்ந்த குறுகிய காலம் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1890 - 1940", "B": "1900 - 1950", "C": "1910 - 1960", "D": "1923 - 1970 (சுமார் 47 ஆண்டுகள் மட்டுமே வாழ்ந்தார்)"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: கு. அழகிரிசாமி 1923-இல் பிறந்து, 1970-இல் தனது 47-ஆவது வயதிலேயே மறைந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What was the brief lifespan of legendary writer Ku. Alagirisamy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1890 - 1940", "B": "1900 - 1950", "C": "1910 - 1960", "D": "1923 - 1970 (lived for about 47 years)"}, "explanation": "He lived between 1923 and 1970."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["கு. அழகிரிசாமி", "காலம்", "1923-1970"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q105", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "other_stories_alagirisamy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கு. அழகிரிசாமியின் புகழ்பெற்ற பிற சிறுகதைகளுள் ஒன்று எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ராஜா வந்திருக்கிறார் (மற்றும் தவப்பயன்)", "B": "கபாடபுரம்", "C": "சாப விமோசனம்", "D": "ஒரு நாள் கழிந்தது"}, "explanation": "கூடுதல் தேர்வுக்குறிப்பு: \"ராஜா வந்திருக்கிறார்\" என்பது கு. அழகிரிசாமியின் மிகச் சிறந்த தலைசிறந்த சிறுகதைகளில் ஒன்றாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which among the following is another iconic short story by Ku. Alagirisamy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Raja Vandhirukkirar", "B": "Kabadapuram", "C": "Saaba Vimochanam", "D": "Oru Naal Kazhinthadhu"}, "explanation": "Raja Vandhirukkirar is a renowned masterpiece by him."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["கு. அழகிரிசாமி", "ராஜா வந்திருக்கிறார்", "சிறுகதைகள்"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-04T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "10th-u9-q106", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "single_choice", "level": "standard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "10", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_9", "lesson_id": "oruvan_irukkiran", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "tnpsc_pyq_alagirisamy_award", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா] கு. அழகிரிசாமிக்கு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது பெற்றுத் தந்த சிறுகதைத் தொகுதி எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தெய்வம் பிறந்தது", "B": "அன்பளிப்பு", "C": "சிரிக்கவில்லை", "D": "இரு சகோதரர்கள்"}, "explanation": "TNPSC முந்தைய ஆண்டு வினா: கு. அழகிரிசாமியின் \"அன்பளிப்பு\" என்னும் சிறுகதைத் தொகுப்பிற்கே 1970-ஆம் ஆண்டு சாகித்திய அகாதெமி விருது கிடைத்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "[TNPSC PYQ] Which short story anthology won the Sahitya Akademi Award for Ku. Alagirisamy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Deivam Piranthadhu", "B": "Anbalippu", "C": "Sirikkavillai", "D": "Iru Sagodharargal"}, "explanation": "Anbalippu won the Sahitya Akademi in 1970."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "10", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 207, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "10th Tamil, Unit 9, Page 207", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year"