{"id": "11th_tamil_u2_q020", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_2", "lesson_id": "prose_iyarkai_velanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "who_said_soil_alive", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மண் என்பது வெறும் துகள் அல்ல; அது கோடிக்கணக்கான நுண்ணுயிர்கள் வாழும் உயிருள்ள தாய்’ என்று முழங்கியவர் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ராசேந்திரன்", "B": "சு. வில்வரத்தினம்", "C": "அ. முத்துலிங்கம்", "D": "கோ. நம்மாழ்வார்"}, "explanation": "மண்ணை வெறும் சடப்பொருளாகப் பார்க்காமல், அது கோடிக்கணக்கான நுண்ணுயிர்களைக் கொண்ட உயிருள்ள அமைப்பு என்று நம்மாழ்வார் போதித்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Who famously proclaimed: 'Soil is not mere lifeless dirt; it is a living, breathing mother teeming with billions of microscopic life forms'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rajendran", "B": "Su. Vilvarathinam", "C": "A. Muthulingam", "D": "G. Nammazhvar"}, "explanation": "Nammazhvar taught that healthy topsoil is a vibrant living organism teeming with microbial biodiversity."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 24, "chapter": null, "section": 