{"id": "11th_tamil_u4_q053", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "11", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_4", "lesson_id": "prose_thamizhaga_kalvi_varalaaru", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "wood_report_vernacular_policy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சார்லஸ் உட் அறிக்கையில் தொடக்கக் கல்வி பயிற்றுவிக்கப்பட வேண்டிய ஊடகமாக எம்மொழி பரிந்துரைக்கப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தாய்மொழி (வட்டார மொழி / Vernacular Language)", "B": "ஆங்கிலம் மட்டுமே", "C": "சமஸ்கிருதம்", "D": "லத்தீன்"}, "explanation": "உட் அறிக்கை தொடக்கக் கல்வியைத் தாய்மொழியிலும், உயர்நிலைக் கல்வியை ஆங்கிலம் மற்றும் தாய்மொழி கலந்தும், கல்லூரிக் கல்வியை ஆங்கிலத்திலும் நடத்தப் பரிந்துரைத்தது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "According to Wood's Despatch (1854), what was the recommended medium of instruction for primary elementary schooling?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Mother tongue / Vernacular native language (தாய்மொழி)", "B": "English exclusively", "C": "Sanskrit", "D": "Latin"}, "explanation": "Wood's Despatch explicitly stipulated the vernacular mother tongue for elementary schooling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "11", "term": "full_year", "edi