{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1178", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "management_functions", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "நவீன மேலாண்மையியல் நிபுணர்கள் குறிப்பிடும் முதன்மையான மேலாண்மைப் பணிகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கட்டளையிடுதல் மட்டும்", "B": "திட்டமிடுதல், ஒழுங்கமைத்தல், ஆள்தேர்வு, வழிநடத்துதல் மற்றும் கட்டுப்படுத்துதல் (Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, Controlling)", "C": "பணத்தை முதலீடு செய்தல் மட்டும்", "D": "விளம்பரம் செய்தல்"}, "explanation": "நவீன மேலாண்மையில் திட்டமிடல் (Planning), ஒழுங்கமைத்தல் (Organizing), பணியாளர் தேர்வு (Staffing), வழிநடத்துதல் (Directing), கட்டுப்படுத்தல் (Controlling) ஆகியவை முதன்மைப் பணிகளாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What primary operational functions constitute the universal core of modern management science?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Issuing arbitrary orders solely", "B": "Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, and Controlling", "C": "Financial speculation only", "D": "Marketing promotion"}, "explanation": "Management science relies on the classic POSDCORB functions: Planning, Organizing, Staffing, Directing, and Controlling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 159, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 159", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Management Functions"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1180", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "hanuman_crisis_management", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கம்பராமாயணத்தில் இலங்கைக்குத் தூது சென்று சீதையைக் கண்ட அனுமன், இராமனிடம் வந்து கூறிய முதல் சொல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சீதை நலமாக இருக்கிறாள்", "B": "இலங்கையை அழித்தேன்", "C": "வணக்கம்", "D": "‘கண்டனன்’ (கண்டனன் கற்பினுக் கணியை...)"}, "explanation": "இராமனின் இதயத் துடிப்பையும் பதற்றத்தையும் தணிக்க, 'சீதையைக் கண்டேன்' என்று தொடங்குவதற்குப் பதிலாக எடுத்தவுடனேயே ‘கண்டனன்’ என்று வெற்றியின் சுருக்கத்தை முதலில் கூறியது மேலாண்மைத் தொடர்புத் திறனின் உச்சமாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Kambar's epic, what exact first word did envoy Hanuman utter to Rama upon returning from Lanka?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Sita is safe", "B": "I burned Lanka", "C": "Salutations", "D": "'Kandanen' (Beheld have I the jewel of chastity!)"}, "explanation": "Hanuman instantly allayed Rama's agony by prioritizing the decisive predicate 'Kandanen' (Beheld have I!)."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Hanuman Crisis Communication"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1183", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "uraiyanbu_books", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "முனைவர் வெ. இறையன்பு அவர்கள் எழுதிய புகழ்பெற்ற மேலாண்மை மற்றும் வழிகாட்டுதல் நூல்களுள் சேராதது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வாய்க்கால் மீன்கள்", "B": "பூனா பாரதி", "C": "அஞ்ஞாடி", "D": "படிப்பது சுகமே"}, "explanation": "‘அஞ்ஞாடி’ நாவலை எழுதியவர் பூமணி ஆவார். வாய்க்கால் மீன்கள் (கவிதை), பூனா பாரதி, படிப்பது சுகமே, இலக்கியத்தில் மேலாண்மை ஆகியவற்றை எழுதியவர் வெ. இறையன்பு."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following titles was NOT authored by Dr. V. Irai Anbu I.A.S.?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Vaaikkaal Meengal", "B": "Poonaa Bharathi", "C": "Agnjaadi", "D": "Padippathu Sugamae"}, "explanation": "'Agnjaadi' was written by Poomani; the other three were authored by Dr. V. Irai Anbu."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Irai Anbu Works"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1184", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pari_water_management", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்க காலத்தில் கபிலர் பாரியின் பறம்பு மலையை வர்ணிக்கும்போது, அங்கு எத்தகைய நீர் மேலாண்மை இயற்கை வளமாக அமைந்திருந்ததாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஆற்றுப் பாசனம்", "B": "கிணற்றுப் பாசனம்", "C": "ஏரிப் பாசனம்", "D": "மழையையும் சுனையையும் மட்டுமே நம்பி உழவர் உழாமலேயே நான்கு வளங்களைத் தரும் இயற்கை நீர் மேலாண்மை"}, "explanation": "பறம்பு மலையில் மூங்கில் நெல், பலாச்சுளை, வள்ளிக்கிழங்கு, தேன் ஆகிய நான்கு வளங்களும் உழவர் உழாமலேயே சுனை நீரால் இயற்கையாக விளைந்த நீர் மேலாண்மையைக் கபிலர் போற்றுகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In Sangam poetry, how did Kapilar characterize the sustainable water ecology of Paari's Parambu hills?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Canal networks", "B": "Deep dug wells", "C": "Artificial reservoir tanks", "D": "Natural spring-fed mountain hydro-ecology yielding four bounties without tillers' ploughing"}, "explanation": "Parambu hills featured natural perennial springs that nourished bamboo rice, jackfruit, tubers, and honey without tilling."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 160, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 160", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Prose", "Parambu Water Management"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1185", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "ilakkiyaththil_melaanmai", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "planning_importance", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘எண்ணித் துணிக கருமம் துணிந்தபின், எண்ணுவம் என்பது இழுக்கு’ - இக்குறள் எதன் இன்றியமையாமையை வலியுறுத்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "முழுமையான முன் திட்டமிடல் (Planning before execution)", "B": "அவசரமாக முடிவெடுத்தல்", "C": "பயந்து பின்வாங்குதல்", "D": "தாமதப்படுத்துதல்"}, "explanation": "நன்றாக ஆய்ந்து திட்டமிட்ட பிறகே ஒரு செயலில் இறங்க வேண்டும்; இறங்கிய பிறகு யோசிக்கலாம் என்பது குற்றமாகும் என்று முன் திட்டமிடலை வள்ளுவர் வலியுறுத்துகிறார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What cardinal corporate principle does 'Ennith thuniga karumam thuninthapin ennuvam enpathu izhukku' enforce?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Rigorous advance planning before execution (Planning before Action)", "B": "Hasty impulse action", "C": "Retreating in fear", "D": "Procrastination"}, "explanation": "Action must be preceded by meticulous planning; hesitating after commencing is disastrous."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corpor