{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1263", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "mangulam_inscription", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் மதுரைக்கு அருகில் உள்ள மாங்குளத்தில் கண்டுபிடித்த கல்வெட்டில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் சங்ககாலப் பாண்டிய மன்னன் யார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "தலையாலங்கானத்துச் செருவென்ற நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "B": "ஆரியப்படை கடந்த நெடுஞ்செழியன்", "C": "நெடுஞ்செழியன் (சங்ககாலத் தொடக்க பாண்டிய மன்னன்)", "D": "பூதப்பாண்டியன்"}, "explanation": "மாங்குளம் கல்வெட்டு 'நெடுஞ்செழியன்' என்ற சங்ககாலப் பாண்டிய மன்னனின் பெயரையும் அவனது படைத்தலைவனையும் மிகத் தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which Sangam Pandyan king is mentioned in the Mangulam inscription near Madurai deciphered by Iravatham Mahadevan?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Nedunchezhiyan victor of Thalaiyalanganam", "B": "Nedunchezhiyan who crossed the Aryan army", "C": "Nedunchezhiyan (Early Sangam Pandyan ruler)", "D": "Boothapandiyan"}, "explanation": "The Mangulam inscription explicitly records the name of the Sangam Pandyan king Nedunchezhiyan and his military commander."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 181, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 181", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Mangulam Inscription"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1264", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "pugalur_inscription", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "கரூர் அருகே புகழூர் ஆனைமலையில் உள்ள சமணர் குகைக் கல்வெட்டு எத்தனை தலைமுறை சேர மன்னர்களின் மரபுப் பெயர்களைக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "ஒரு தலைமுறை", "B": "இரண்டு தலைமுறை", "C": "நான்கு தலைமுறை", "D": "மூன்று தலைமுறை"}, "explanation": "புகழூர்க் கல்வெட்டு கோ ஆதன் செல்லிரும்பொறை, பெருங்கடுங்கோ, இளங்கடுங்கோ ஆகிய மூன்று தலைமுறை சேர மன்னர்களை வரிசையாகக் குறிப்பிடுகிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "How many generations of Chera monarchs are chronologically recorded in the Jain cave inscriptions at Pugalur near Karur?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "One generation", "B": "Two generations", "C": "Four generations", "D": "Three generations"}, "explanation": "The Pugalur inscription chronologically mentions three generations of Chera kings: Ko Athan Cheral Irumporai, Perunkadungo, and Ilankadungo."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 182, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 182", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Pugalur Inscription"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1265", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "jambai_inscription", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "அசோகரது கல்வெட்டுகளில் குறிப்பிடப்படும் 'ஸதியபுதோ' (சத்தியபுத்திரர்) என்னும் வடமொழிப் பெயர் சங்ககாலத் தகடூர் அதியமான் நெடுமான் அஞ்சியையே குறிக்கிறது என்பதை உறுதிப்படுத்திய கல்வெட்டு எங்கு கண்டறியப்பட்டது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "விழுப்புரம் மாவட்டம் ஜம்பை", "B": "மதுரை மாவட்டம் மாங்குளம்", "C": "கரூர் மாவட்டம் புகழூர்", "D": "புதுக்கோட்டை மாவட்டம் சித்தன்னவாசல்"}, "explanation": "விழுப்புரம் மாவட்டம் திருக்கோவிலூர் அருகே உள்ள ஜம்பை மலையில் 'ஸதியபுதோ அதியந் நெடுமாந் அஞ்சி ஈத்த பாழி' என்ற கல்வெட்டு கண்டுபிடிக்கப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Where was the inscription discovered that confirmed the Ashokan edict title 'Satyaputo' refers to the Sangam Tagadur chieftain Adiyaman Neduman Anji?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Jambai in Villupuram district", "B": "Mangulam in Madurai district", "C": "Pugalur in Karur district", "D": "Sittannavasal in Pudukkottai district"}, "explanation": "At Jambai near Tirukkovilur in Villupuram district, the inscription 'Satyaputo Athiyan Neduman Anji eetha paazhi' was discovered."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 183, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 7, Page 183", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 7", "Supplementary", "Jambai Inscription"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u7_q1266", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "easy", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_7", "lesson_id": "sangkakala_kalvettu", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "early_tamil_epigraphy", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஐராவதம் மகாதேவன் தமிழ்-பிராமி கல்வெட்டுகளை முப்பதாண்டுகளுக்கும் மேலாக ஆராய்ந்து 2003-ஆம் ஆண்டு வெளியிட்ட உலகப்புகழ்பெற்ற ஆய்வு நூல் எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables", "B": "Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.", "C": "South Indian Inscriptions", "D": "Epigraphia Indica"}, "explanation": "ஹார்வர்டு பல்கலைக்கழக வெளியீடாகவும் பின்னர் க்ரியா பதிப்பகத்தாலும் 'Early Tamil Epigraphy' என்ற மகத்தான ஆய்வு நூல் 2003-இல் வெளியிடப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which world-renowned research monograph did Iravatham Mahadevan publish in 2003 after researching Tamil-Brahmi inscriptions for over 30 years?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "The Indus Script: Texts, Concordance and Tables", "B": "Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.", "C": "South Indian Inscriptions", "D": "Epigraphia Indica"}, "explanation": "His magnum opus 'Early Tamil Epigraphy: From the Earliest Times to the Sixth Century A.D.' was published in 2003 by Harvard University and Cre-A."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "nega