{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1390", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "drawings_skill", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி கல்வெட்டுகள் மற்றும் சிலைகளை ஆராய்ந்ததோடு அமையாமல் அவரே நேரில் மேற்கொண்ட மற்றொரு கலைப்பணி யாது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சிற்பங்களைச் செதுக்குதல்", "B": "சிலைகள் மற்றும் கல்வெட்டுகளைத் தாமே துல்லியமாகக் கோட்டோவியங்களாக வரைதல் (Line drawings)", "C": "நாடகம் நடித்தல்", "D": "இசைக்கருவி மீட்டல்"}, "explanation": "சிறந்த ஓவிய ஆற்றல் பெற்றிருந்த மயிலையார், தாம் ஆய்வு செய்த கல்வெட்டுகள் மற்றும் சிற்பங்களைத் தாமே கைப்படக் கோட்டோவியங்களாக வரைந்து நூல்களில் இணைத்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Besides decoding epigraphs and sculptures, what rare artistic skill did Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy directly apply to his books?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Chiseling stone sculptures", "B": "Drawing precise technical line sketches and architectural illustrations with his own hand", "C": "Performing theatrical plays", "D": "Playing classical instruments"}, "explanation": "Possessing artistic skill, he drew precise hand-sketched line drawings of sculptures and epigraphs for his monographs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 193, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 193", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Artistic Talent"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1391", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "sangam_literature_research", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சங்ககால மூவேந்தர்களின் வரலாற்றைத் தொகுத்து மயிலையார் எழுதிய நூல்களுள் தவறானது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "சேரன் செங்குட்டுவன்", "B": "கொங்கு நாட்டு வரலாறு", "C": "முகலாயர் பேரரசு", "D": "துளுநாட்டு வரலாறு"}, "explanation": "சேரன் செங்குட்டுவன், கொங்கு நாட்டு வரலாறு, துளுநாட்டு வரலாறு ஆகிய அனைத்தையும் மயிலையார் எழுதினார்; முகலாயர் பேரரசு அவர் எழுதியதன்று."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following regional history works was NOT authored by Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Cheran Senguttuvan", "B": "History of Kongu Nadu", "C": "Mughal Empire", "D": "History of Tulu Nadu"}, "explanation": "He wrote extensively on Cheran Senguttuvan, Kongu Nadu, and Tulu Nadu, but not on the Mughal Empire."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 195, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 195", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Regional History"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1392", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "nationalization_books", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமியின் படைப்புகள் மற்றும் நூல்கள் தமிழ்நாடு அரசால் எந்த ஆண்டு நாட்டுடைமை ஆக்கப்பட்டன?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1990", "B": "1995", "C": "2000", "D": "2006 (மற்றும் அரசு நூல்களாகப் பதிப்பித்தல்)"}, "explanation": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமியின் அரிய நூல்கள் அனைத்தும் தமிழ்நாடு அரசால் நாட்டுடைமை ஆக்கப்பட்டு உலகெங்கும் உள்ள தமிழர்களுக்குக் கிடைக்க வழிவகை செய்யப்பட்டது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "In which decade were Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy's literary and historical works nationalized by the Tamil Nadu Government?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "1990", "B": "1995", "C": "2000", "D": "2006 (Nationalized as public domain treasures)"}, "explanation": "The Government of Tamil Nadu nationalized all works of Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy in 2006."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 196, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 196", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Nationalization"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1393", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "marainthupona_authors", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "‘மறைந்துபோன தமிழ் நூல்கள்’ என்ற நூலில் மயிலையார் மீட்டெடுத்த நூல்களுள் பொருந்தாதது எது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "கம்பராமாயணம்", "B": "தகடூர் யாத்திரை", "C": "குண்டலகேசி (கிடைத்த பாடல்கள்)", "D": "வளையாபதி (கிடைத்த பாடல்கள்)"}, "explanation": "கம்பராமாயணம் அழியாமல் முழுமையாக உள்ள பெருங்காப்பியமாகும்; தகடூர் யாத்திரை, குண்டலகேசி, வளையாபதி முதலான மறைந்துபோன நூல்களின் சுவடுகளையே அவர் திரட்டினார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following books is NOT among the lost/partially lost works compiled in 'Maraindhupona Thamizh Noolgal'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Kamba Ramayanam (Fully extant epic)", "B": "Tagadur Yaathirai", "C": "Kundalakesi (Surviving verses)", "D": "Valaiyapathi (Surviving verses)"}, "explanation": "Kamba Ramayanam is a completely extant epic, whereas Tagadur Yaathirai, Kundalakesi, and Valaiyapathi were lost texts reconstructed by him."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 194, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 194", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Lost Books"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1395", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "unselfish_dedication", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி எத்தகைய பொருளாதாரச் சூழலில் தமது வரலாற்று ஆய்வுகளை மேற்கொண்டார்?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "அரண்மனை ஆதரவில் பெரும் செல்வச் செழிப்புடன்", "B": "வெளிநாட்டுப் பல்கலைக்கழகங்களின் பெரும் நிதியுதவியுடன்", "C": "எளிய ஆசிரியப் பணியின் குறைந்த வருவாயிலும், வறுமையிலும் தமிழ் ஆர்வத்தால் தமக்கென வாழாது", "D": "தொழில் நிறுவனங்களின் விளம்பர ஆதரவுடன்"}, "explanation": "மிக எளிய தொடக்கப்பள்ளி ஆசிரியராகப் பணிபுரிந்து, குறைந்த வருவாயிலும் குடும்பச் சூழலிலும் தம் சொந்தப் பணத்தைச் செலவழித்தே சுவடிகளைத் தேடி நூல்களை வெளியிட்டார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Under what socio-economic circumstances did Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy pursue his research?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "In opulent royal patronage with abundant riches", "B": "With multi-million foreign university research grants", "C": "On a meager schoolteacher's wage, weathering financial constraints with pure selfless devotion", "D": "With corporate marketing sponsorship"}, "explanation": "He conducted his landmark investigations purely on his modest primary teacher salary, enduring poverty with stoic dedication."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 193, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": "12th Tamil, Unit 8, Page 193", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["Class 12", "Unit 8", "Prose", "Dedication"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-05T12:00:00Z"}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "12th_tamil_u8_q1396", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "hard", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "unit_8", "lesson_id": "mayilai_seeni_venkatasamy", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "valarchiyin_padigal", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "மயிலை சீனி. வேங்கடசாமி எழுதிய ‘துளுநாட்டு வரலாறு’ என்னும் நூல் எதன் முக்கியத்துவத்தை வெளிப்படுத்துகிறது?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "வடநாட்டு அரசர்களின் படையெடுப்பு", "B": "ஐரோப்பிய வணிகம்", "C": "இமயமலைப் பயணம்", "D": "பண்டைத் தமிழகத்தின் எல்லைப்பகுதியாக விளங்கிய துளுநாட்டின் மொழியியல் மற்றும் வரலாற்றுத் தொடர்புகள்"}, "explanation": "பண்டைய சங்ககாலத் தமிழகத்தின் வடமேற்கு எல்லையாக விளங்கிய துளுநாடு (நன்னன் ஆண்ட நாடு) பற்றிய வரலாற்று உண்மைகளை வெளிக்கொணர்ந்தார்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What historical significance does Mayilai Seeni. Venkatasamy's 'History of Tulu Nadu' bring to light?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Invasions of North Indian kings", "B": "European colonial commerce", "C": "Himalayan expeditions", "D": "Linguistic and historical ties of Tulu Nadu, which formed the northwestern periphery of ancient Tamilakam"}, "explanation": "His treatise proved the historical and cultural integration of Tulu Nadu (ruled by chieftain Nannan) with ancient Tamilakam."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_