{"id": "12th_tamil_mp1_q1639", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "multiple_choice", "level": "medium", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "12", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "megapack_1", "lesson_id": "synoptic_mock_3", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ci_mani_poetic_craft", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சி. மணியின் ‘இடையீடு’ கவிதையில் கூறப்படும் மூன்று நிலைகள் எவை?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "எழுத்து, சொல், பொருள்", "B": "இயற்கை, மனிதன், கடவுள்", "C": "கவிஞன் (படைப்பாளி) -> கவிதை (படைப்பு) -> வாசகன் (அனுபவிப்பவன்)", "D": "பிறப்பு, வாழ்வு, இறப்பு"}, "explanation": "கவிஞன் நினைப்பதை மொழியில் வடித்தலும், அந்த மொழி வாசகனை அடைந்து அவனுக்குள் உணர்வைத் தூண்டுதலும் ஆகிய மூவகைத் தொடர்புகளை இக்கவிதை ஆராய்கிறது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What three communicative triads are critically explored in C. Mani's poem 'Idaiyeedu'?", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "Letter, Word, Meaning", "B": "Nature, Human, God", "C": "The Poet (Creator) -> The Poem (Text) -> The Reader (Receptor)", "D": "Birth, Life, Death"}, "explanation": "The poem analyzes the communicative triad: Creator conceiving thought, text encoding it, and reader decoding it."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "explanation_key": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "12", "term": "full_year", "edi